window.HEALTH_DATA={"meta":{"title":"Codes of Light for Your Health · A Dictionary of Inner Listening","version":"2026-10-26.salud.1","status":"propuesta_editorial","scope":"An initial collection of 120 health conditions and topics, open to expansion and review by the author; it is not presented as an inventory of every disease.","opening":"Connect with this vibration to listen to your inner experience, recognize what needs attention, and make room for understanding.","framework":"In the vision of the Codes of Light, the Flame expresses the divine presence that descends into embodiment and finds expression in life. This exploration invites you to receive that presence and bring it to an intention of your own choosing.","editorialPolicy":"Original reflections proposed for Zuluan Orion's review. Medical sources support only the general definitions. Triads retain their published context, order, and purpose; the person chooses an intention, not a formula assigned to a disease. Do not attribute physical causes to emotions, patterns, or vibrations; do not promise clinical effects or changes in treatment.","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26","entryCount":120,"intentionCount":21,"language":"en"},"intents":[{"id":"descanso","title":"Rest and rhythm","description":"I want to honor my need for rest.","formulaId":"energy-r60-p728-c0456-f01","sourceRationale":"The book's selection table links this triad with restoring rhythm and rest."},{"id":"claridad","title":"Clarity and understanding","description":"I want to distinguish what I know, what I feel, and what I need to ask.","formulaId":"energy-p056-f01","sourceRationale":"The practice invites you to observe before drawing conclusions and to distinguish facts from interpretations."},{"id":"expresion","title":"Expressing my needs","description":"I want to find the words for a request or a conversation.","formulaId":"energy-p241-f01","sourceRationale":"The Clarity intelligence works with a simple sentence that expresses what you need to say."},{"id":"compasion","title":"Tenderness and compassion","description":"I want to treat myself kindly and recognize the care I can receive.","formulaId":"energy-r60-p641-c0373-f01","sourceRationale":"The source proposes acknowledging your own suffering and that of others, then choosing care that is useful and possible."},{"id":"apoyo","title":"Presence and support","description":"I want to recognize where I am and what supports me.","formulaId":"energy-p670-f01","sourceRationale":"The practice invites you to recognize your physical presence and the support available to you."},{"id":"tristeza","title":"Welcoming my sadness","description":"I want to make room for the sadness I am feeling.","formulaId":"energy-r60-p645-c0377-f01","sourceRationale":"The Sadness state is met with acceptance, listening, and companionship."},{"id":"limites","title":"Boundaries and choice","description":"I want to express what I am available for and honor my decisions.","formulaId":"energy-p099-f01","sourceRationale":"Foundational Boundary supports consent and the freedom to choose how you relate to others."},{"id":"escucha_receptiva","title":"Listening while staying true to my position","description":"I want to listen to another person without confusing understanding them with accepting everything.","formulaId":"heart-366-f01","sourceRationale":"This entry distinguishes receiving what another person expresses from accepting everything or abandoning your own boundaries.","sourceEvidence":"A doorway with a frame: listen fully and say where your limits are. You can receive someone fully without accepting everything.","sourcePage":386,"originalTitle":"RECEPTIVITY WITH BOUNDARIES","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Heart","sourceContext":"Listening and boundaries within a relationship; this formula is not assigned on the basis of a disease or symptom."},{"id":"confianza_discernida","title":"Allowing trust to grow gradually","description":"I want to recognize how much trust I can offer and what needs more time.","formulaId":"energy-p194-f01","sourceRationale":"Discerning Trust proposes opening up gradually in response to facts, time, consistency, and reciprocity, while retaining the freedom to reconsider.","sourceEvidence":"Your heart does not need to open every door at once. A relationship reveals how it receives your truth, your differences, and your right to say no. Let trust grow through that experience. Openness gains depth when you can choose it and retain the freedom to reconsider how much you share.","sourcePage":188,"originalTitle":"Discerning Trust","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"Trust here refers to a relationship and how much to share; it does not mean confidence in a medical outcome."},{"id":"incertidumbre","title":"Making room for what I do not yet know","description":"I want to recognize what I observed, how I interpret it, and what I still need to learn.","formulaId":"energy-p329-f01","sourceRationale":"Humility in Knowing allows you to honor an experience without turning its interpretation into certainty; it invites you to keep a question open and a conclusion provisional.","sourceEvidence":"An experience can move you deeply and still leave its interpretation open. Humility allows you to honor what you have lived without requiring another person to accept it as proof. You can recognize what you know and retain a loving regard for what you do not yet understand.","sourcePage":323,"originalTitle":"Humility in Knowing","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"This reflects on the relationship between experience and interpretation; the practice does not confirm spiritual explanations for a disease."},{"id":"eleccion_consciente","title":"Choosing a possible next step","description":"I want to recognize my options and make a provisional decision without requiring complete certainty.","formulaId":"energy-p150-f01","sourceRationale":"Choice works with distinguishing options, acknowledging uncertainty, and making an honest decision for the present moment.","sourceEvidence":"Every choice gives something a place and leaves another possibility waiting. That is why deciding can hurt a little, even when you choose well. Choice accepts this human condition. Look at what you know, acknowledge what is uncertain, and find a response that is honest enough for the moment you are in.","sourcePage":144,"originalTitle":"Choice","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"Agency in everyday decisions; this is not an instruction to change treatments or make clinical decisions through a triad."},{"id":"adaptacion","title":"Adapting while keeping what matters","description":"I want to adjust my pace or the way I do something without losing what I value.","formulaId":"energy-p120-f01","sourceRationale":"Adaptive Flow supports a change in pace or strategy while preserving identity, boundaries, and purpose.","sourceEvidence":"Life changes shape. An agreement needs a different pace. A project calls for a different approach. Adaptive Flow listens to that change and recognizes what deserves to remain. You can adjust your step and stay true to what you care for.","sourcePage":112,"originalTitle":"Adaptive Flow","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"Adapting agreements, projects, and ways of acting; the formula is not attributed with causing physiological adaptation."},{"id":"duelo_memoria","title":"Being with grief when it returns","description":"I want to make room for the memory of a loss and recognize the companionship I need.","formulaId":"energy-r60-p715-c0440-f01","sourceRationale":"When Grief Returns refers to a loss becoming present again through a date, a scent, or a song; it invites you to acknowledge the memory and respect its timing.","sourceEvidence":"What often happens. A date, a scent, or a song, and the loss is here again.\nAfterward. Quietly name the person you miss. If grief overwhelms you, seek companionship.","sourcePage":715,"originalTitle":"When Grief Returns","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"The specific context is grief that resurfaces. The edition marks ACTIVATE · acceptance and support; it does not propose purging or erasing grief."},{"id":"constancia_cuidada","title":"Continuing with patience and care","description":"I want to sustain what matters while recognizing when to continue, rest, or change my approach.","formulaId":"energy-p158-f01","sourceRationale":"Perseverance includes continuity, rest, help, and reconsidering the method; it does not demand endurance or maintaining a harmful strategy.","sourceEvidence":"Some endeavors grow because you return to them. You come back after resting, encounter a difficulty, and adjust your approach. Perseverance knows this rhythm. Its commitment includes caring for the person doing the work.","sourcePage":152,"originalTitle":"Perseverance","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"Continuing a chosen task or commitment, with room to pause and adapt; it is not used to demand recovery."},{"id":"reciprocidad","title":"Giving and receiving freely","description":"I want to recognize what I can offer, what I need to ask for, and what I cannot sustain.","formulaId":"energy-p126-f01","sourceRationale":"Reciprocity supports giving, receiving, asking, or declining with autonomy and a sense of proportion, without turning the relationship into a debt.","sourceEvidence":"A relationship has room for two experiences. You can offer something valuable and hear that the other person needs something different. You can receive without losing yourself in a sense of debt. Reciprocity grows when each person can clearly state what they offer, what they need, and what they cannot sustain.","sourcePage":118,"originalTitle":"Reciprocity","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"Exchange within a specific relationship, respecting consent and differences."},{"id":"pertenencia","title":"Taking part without hiding myself","description":"I want to share a space without hiding who I am out of fear of rejection.","formulaId":"energy-p097-f01","sourceRationale":"Belonging uses this formula specifically for fear of rejection when expressing yourself or when things go well; it preserves both closeness and individuality.","sourceEvidence":"In this practice, we will look particularly at the fear of being rejected when you express yourself or when something goes well for you. The chosen formula comes from that context. If your experience is different, you can begin with the mother triad and the general intention of having a place.","sourcePage":89,"originalTitle":"Belonging","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"Keep this specific scope: fear of rejection when expressing yourself or succeeding. Do not turn it into a general formula for every form of loneliness."},{"id":"dignidad","title":"Recognizing my worth without having to prove it","description":"I want to treat myself with respect without measuring my worth by performance or approval.","formulaId":"energy-p146-f01","sourceRationale":"Dignity recognizes your worth without relying on comparison, performance, or immediate approval.","sourceEvidence":"You can reach a difficult day and feel that your entire worth is at stake. Work that did not turn out as hoped, a reply that never came, a comparison that made you feel small. Pause for a moment. The life you are is still here. Dignity allows you to show up with that presence, recognize what you can contribute, and treat yourself with the same respect you offer any other human being.","sourcePage":140,"originalTitle":"Dignity","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"Self-worth and how you treat yourself; dignity is not conditional on health, productivity, or the outcome of a practice."},{"id":"ecuanimidad","title":"Responding without denying what I feel","description":"I want to make room for an emotion and choose a proportionate response.","formulaId":"energy-p327-f01","sourceRationale":"Equanimity allows emotion to take part without deciding everything, and proposes a thoughtful, proportionate, and reversible response.","sourceEvidence":"You can feel displeasure and still respond with care. Equanimity does not ask you to become unfeeling; it allows emotion to take part without deciding everything. Notice how much a conversation changes when you do not need to push discomfort away immediately.","sourcePage":321,"originalTitle":"Equanimity","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"An everyday response to pleasure, discomfort, or uncertainty; it does not promise to eliminate emotions or regulate a clinical condition."},{"id":"integracion_cotidiana","title":"Bringing understanding into daily life","description":"I want to choose a small action that consistently expresses what I value.","formulaId":"energy-p701-f01","sourceRationale":"The protocol invites you to consider the relationship between feeling, valuing, speaking, and doing, and to choose a concrete adjustment or action without requiring everything to be resolved.","sourceEvidence":"Write four short sentences: I feel, I value, I say, and I do. Notice where there is a gap you can attend to. After the code, connect a value with a small action that makes it visible.","sourcePage":707,"originalTitle":"Giving Form to What You Have Understood · Tracing, Meditation, and Action","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"Integrating an understanding into an everyday action; preserve the closing of the practice before bringing the action into the relationship or task."},{"id":"pedir_apoyo","title":"Asking for and receiving help","description":"I want to recognize the help available and receive it while retaining my autonomy.","formulaId":"energy-p095-f01","sourceRationale":"The Support intelligence concerns receiving cooperation and recognizing what you need to ask for without handing over your decisions.","sourceEvidence":"Support recognizes cooperation. A chair holds part of your weight; a person can listen to you; a decision can wait until you have the resources you need. Life finds continuity when you know what you can count on and what you need to ask for.","sourcePage":87,"originalTitle":"Support","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"Support here names the human capacity to receive help; it is distinct from Sustaining as the second position in any triad."},{"id":"autoacogida","title":"Listening to my experience without judgment","description":"I want to make room for something I feel without rejecting it or automatically following every impulse.","formulaId":"energy-p186-f01","sourceRationale":"Self-Acceptance proposes receiving part of your experience with dignity while maintaining a responsible response.","sourceEvidence":"There is something in you that has long been waiting to be received. Perhaps it is tiredness. Perhaps anger you feel ashamed of, or a need you learned to hide. Give it a place. Self-Acceptance allows you to listen to that part without letting it take over your life.","sourcePage":180,"originalTitle":"Self-Acceptance","sourceBook":"Codes of Light for Your Energy","sourceContext":"Welcoming the experience chosen by the person; it does not interpret that experience as the cause of a disease or as a command that must be obeyed."}],"entries":[{"id":"acne","title":"Acne","category":"Skin","aliases":["pimples","spots","acne breakouts","espinillas","barros","granitos","Acné"],"definition":"A common skin condition in which hair follicles become blocked and pimples develop. It can affect the face, chest, back, and other areas, sometimes leaving scars.","source":{"title":"Acne","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/acne.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Seeing more of who you are","reflection":"You can explore the role your appearance is playing in how you see yourself and relate to others. The Flame invites you to recognize a fuller presence, with room for your voice, abilities, relationships, and the experiences you want to share.","questions":["What quality in myself would I like to recognize today?","What comment about my appearance would I prefer to hear expressed differently?","What encounter would I like to enjoy while being myself?"],"phrase":"I can recognize my whole presence and express myself freely.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","compasion","limites"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"addison","title":"Addison's Disease","category":"Hormonal Health","aliases":["Addison disease","Addison's disease","primary adrenal insufficiency","insuficiencia suprarrenal primaria","insuficiencia adrenal primaria","Addison","Enfermedad de Addison"],"definition":"A condition in which the adrenal glands cannot produce enough of certain hormones, especially cortisol and sometimes aldosterone. It can affect energy, blood pressure, and salt balance.","source":{"title":"Addison's Disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/addisondisease.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Building support you can recognize","reflection":"Living with ongoing care needs may invite you to consider who understands those needs and how you wish to communicate them. The Flame accompanies a presence actively engaged in its own life. You can explore what information to share and what agreements would make your surroundings more attentive to you.","questions":["Who understands what I need in my everyday care?","What agreement would I like to make with someone close to me?","What question would help me organize things more clearly?"],"phrase":"I can make agreements and recognize support for my everyday life.","suggestedIntents":["pedir_apoyo","constancia_cuidada","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"alopecia-areata","title":"Alopecia areata","category":"Skin And Hair","aliases":["patchy alopecia","autoimmune hair loss","alopecia en placas","alopecia autoinmune","Alopecia areata"],"definition":"An autoimmune condition that can cause hair loss in round patches and sometimes in larger areas. It can affect the scalp and other parts of the body.","source":{"title":"Alopecia areata","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/001450.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing what changes and what remains","reflection":"Changes in hair can bring up different feelings for each person. You can listen to them freely, without rushing to adopt a particular attitude. The Flame offers an image of inner continuity from which to recognize your identity and choose how you want to present yourself.","questions":["What do I feel when I look at this change?","What aspects of my identity would I like to recognize today?","How do I want to present myself, and what support would help me make that choice?"],"phrase":"I can make room for my feelings and choose how I present myself.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","tristeza","autoacogida"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"alzheimer","title":"Alzheimer's Disease","category":"Neurology","aliases":["Alzheimer disease","Alzheimer's disease","Alzheimer dementia","Alzheimer","demencia por Alzheimer","Enfermedad de Alzheimer"],"definition":"A progressive brain disease that affects memory, thinking, and language and can make everyday activities difficult. It is a common cause of dementia.","reflectionHeading":"Meeting in the present","reflection":"For someone living with Alzheimer's and those supporting them, a kind encounter can matter without requiring memories or correct answers. In this proposal, the Flame represents the person's dignity. Closeness is offered according to their preferences, and the caregiver deserves support too.","questions":["What simple forms of companionship feel pleasant today?","How can we respect the person's preferences in this moment?","Who can also support those providing care?"],"phrase":"We can meet each other with respect in this moment.","suggestedIntents":["compasion","apoyo","tristeza"],"source":{"title":"Alzheimer's Disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/alzheimersdisease.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"espondilitis-anquilosante","title":"Ankylosing Spondylitis","category":"Movement And Joints","aliases":["ankylosing spondylitis","radiographic axial spondyloarthritis","rheumatoid spondylitis","espondilitis reumatoide","espondiloartritis axial radiografica","Espondilitis anquilosante"],"definition":"A type of arthritis that inflames joints in the spine and where it meets the pelvis. It can cause pain, stiffness, and restricted movement.","source":{"title":"Ankylosing Spondylitis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ankylosingspondylitis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Choosing how you take part","reflection":"You can ask which activities are meaningful to you and what conditions make it easier to take part. The Flame accompanies a listening to your current capacity, preferences, and relationships, giving each choice room to include what you need and what you value.","questions":["What activity connects me with something important to me?","What conditions would help me take part more comfortably?","What do I need to discuss about my availability?"],"phrase":"I can choose how to take part and express what I value.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","eleccion_consciente","limites"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"anorexia-nerviosa","title":"Anorexia nervosa","category":"Eating Disorders","aliases":["anorexia nervosa","anorexia nerviosa","Anorexia nerviosa"],"definition":"An eating disorder involving restricted food intake, an intense fear of weight gain, and disturbances in body perception. It can seriously compromise physical and emotional health.","source":{"title":"Anorexia","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/000362.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Receiving care with dignity","reflection":"You can approach this reflection through the dignity of your life and the possibility of receiving companionship. The Flame can symbolize a kind presence, attentive to who you are in your relationships, interests, and wishes. Choose a question you can share with your support team.","questions":["What quality in myself would I like to recognize beyond my appearance?","What kind of companionship helps me speak honestly?","What need do I want to express to the people involved in my care?"],"phrase":"My life deserves care, listening, and companionship.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","compasion","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"asma","title":"Asthma","category":"Respiratory Health","aliases":["bronchial asthma","allergic asthma","asma bronquial","asma alergica","Asma"],"definition":"A chronic disease in which the airways can become inflamed and narrowed, causing episodes of coughing, wheezing, and chest tightness.","source":{"title":"Asthma","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/asthma.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Finding inner companionship","reflection":"In a moment of comfortable rest, you can contemplate the Flame as an image of companionship. Let your attention recognize the support around you and the words you would like to share with someone you trust.","questions":["What helps me feel accompanied in everyday life?","What do I want another person to know about what I am going through?","What intention would I like to bring into a quiet moment?"],"phrase":"I can receive companionship and express what I need.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["apoyo","expresion","confianza_discernida"]},{"id":"dermatitis-atopica","title":"Atopic dermatitis","category":"Skin","aliases":["atopic eczema","eczema","atopic dermatitis","eccema atopico","eczema atopico","eccema","Dermatitis atópica"],"definition":"A common form of eczema that causes dry, itchy, irritated skin. It is frequent in childhood, also affects adults, and may alternate between improvement and worsening.","source":{"title":"Eczema","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/eczema.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Relating to yourself with tenderness","reflection":"You can explore how you feel in everyday life and in encounters with other people. The image of the Flame invites a kind regard that recognizes your dignity and leaves room for you to express your preferences.","questions":["How would I like others to support me when I am uncomfortable?","What comments or questions would I prefer to hear expressed differently?","What quality in myself do I want to recognize beyond my appearance?"],"phrase":"My dignity and my voice have a place in every encounter.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","compasion","limites"]},{"id":"fibrilacion-auricular","title":"Atrial Fibrillation","category":"Cardiovascular Health","aliases":["atrial fibrillation","AF","AFib","atrial fibrillation and flutter","FA","fibrilacion atrial","fibriloaleteo auricular","Fibrilación auricular"],"definition":"A heart rhythm disturbance that causes irregular and sometimes rapid beats. The upper and lower chambers of the heart lose some of their usual coordination.","source":{"title":"Atrial Fibrillation","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/atrialfibrillation.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Finding words for uncertainty","reflection":"When a bodily experience brings uncertainty, you can distinguish what you observe from the stories you imagine. The Flame can accompany a pause for understanding: listening to your questions, recognizing your sources of support, and choosing whom to ask for information or companionship.","questions":["What do I know about my experience, and what do I need to ask?","What thought is taking up the most space within me?","What conversation would help me feel supported?"],"phrase":"I can listen to my questions and seek clarity with support.","suggestedIntents":["incertidumbre","claridad","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"tdah","title":"Attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder","category":"Neurodevelopment","aliases":["TDAH","ADHD","deficit de atencion e hiperactividad","attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder","attention deficit hyperactivity disorder","Trastorno por déficit de atención e hiperactividad"],"definition":"A neurodevelopmental disorder involving persistent difficulties with attention, impulsivity, and, in some people, hyperactivity. It begins in childhood and can continue into adulthood.","source":{"title":"Attention-Deficit/Hyperactivity Disorder","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/attentiondeficithyperactivitydisorder.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing your way of participating","reflection":"You can notice what conditions make it easier for a task to have a clear starting point for you. The Flame can accompany one small, specific intention. You can also recognize your interests, ask for a simpler agreement, and put into words the kind of support you find useful.","questions":["What task do I want to look at one at a time?","What change in my surroundings would help me participate?","How can I explain the help I need?"],"phrase":"I can find a way of participating that recognizes my needs.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","dignidad","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"paralisis-bell","title":"Bell’s palsy","category":"Neurology","aliases":["paralisis facial de Bell","paralisis del nervio facial","Bell’s palsy","Bell's palsy","facial nerve palsy","Bell facial paralysis","Parálisis de Bell"],"definition":"A condition of the facial nerve that causes rapidly developing weakness or paralysis, usually on one side of the face, and may affect the ability to close the eye.","reflectionHeading":"Your expression goes beyond your face","reflection":"A visible change in your face can affect how you feel when meeting other people. You can decide how much you want to explain and what you want to keep private. In the language of the Flame, your presence and worth do not depend on a particular facial expression or on responding to other people’s looks.","questions":["What would you like others to know when speaking with you?","What questions would you prefer not to answer for now?","What form of expression feels comfortable at this moment?"],"phrase":"I can express who I am in many ways and choose my boundaries.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","expresion","compasion"],"source":{"title":"Bell’s Palsy","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/bellspalsy.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"hiperplasia-prostatica-benigna","title":"Benign Prostatic Hyperplasia","category":"Kidney And Urinary Health","aliases":["BPH","benign prostatic hyperplasia","enlarged prostate","benign prostatic hypertrophy","HPB","prostata agrandada","hipertrofia prostatica benigna","Hiperplasia prostática benigna"],"definition":"Noncancerous enlargement of the prostate that can compress the urethra and make it difficult for urine to flow out. It becomes more common with age.","source":{"title":"Enlarged Prostate","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/enlargedprostatebph.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Talking freely about changes","reflection":"Bodily changes can raise questions about everyday life, intimacy, or your stage of life. You can contemplate the Flame as a presence that supports your voice, making room for what you want to understand and the conversations you choose to have.","questions":["What questions do I have about the changes I am experiencing?","What subject would I like to discuss more freely?","What would help me feel comfortable expressing an intimate concern?"],"phrase":"I can discuss my changes with clarity and respect.","suggestedIntents":["claridad","expresion","confianza_discernida"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"trastorno-atracon","title":"Binge-eating disorder","category":"Eating Disorders","aliases":["trastorno por atracones","trastorno de atracon","binge-eating disorder","binge eating disorder","BED","Trastorno por atracón"],"definition":"An eating disorder involving recurrent episodes of eating large amounts with a sense of lost control and significant distress, without regular compensatory behaviors such as those seen in bulimia.","source":{"title":"Definition and Facts for Binge-Eating Disorder","url":"https://www.niddk.nih.gov/health-information/informacion-de-la-salud/control-de-peso/trastorno-por-atracon/definicion-hechos","organization":"NIDDK · National Institutes of Health","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Finding respectful listening","reflection":"You can notice what you need in order to speak about your experience with confidence. The image of the Flame can accompany a broad view of your life: your relationships, interests, and need for care. Choose a question that opens a kind, specific conversation.","questions":["What do I need someone else to understand about my experience?","What kind of comment helps me, and what would I prefer to avoid?","With whom would I like to discuss the support I am looking for?"],"phrase":"I can ask for listening that respects my dignity.","suggestedIntents":["autoacogida","compasion","limites"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"trastorno-bipolar","title":"Bipolar disorder","category":"Mental Health","aliases":["bipolaridad","trastorno bipolar I","trastorno bipolar II","bipolar disorder","bipolar I disorder","bipolar II disorder","Trastorno bipolar"],"definition":"A mood disorder involving episodes of mania or hypomania and, often, depression. It can significantly change energy, activity, and behavior.","source":{"title":"Bipolar Disorder","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/bipolardisorder.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Sustaining relationships and decisions with patience","reflection":"You can explore what routines, relationships, and agreements help you take part in everyday life. Within this contemplation, the Flame represents a calm, close presence. You can give your decisions time and share your observations with people who know your experience.","questions":["What everyday agreement is useful for me to maintain?","With whom can I review an important decision?","What change would I like to communicate to my support team?"],"phrase":"I can give my decisions time and welcome a caring perspective.","suggestedIntents":["constancia_cuidada","pedir_apoyo","claridad"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"cancer-mama","title":"Breast cancer","category":"Cancer Support","aliases":["breast cancer","mammary cancer","cancer de seno","cancer mamario","Cáncer de mama"],"definition":"A disease in which cells in breast tissue grow uncontrollably. Different types may remain localized or spread to nearby tissues and other parts of the body.","source":{"title":"Breast cancer","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/breastcancer.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Choosing how to receive closeness","reflection":"You can ask what closeness you want and what space you want to preserve during this process. The Flame can represent companionship that honors your voice and privacy. Each person experiences their body, relationships, and decisions in their own way; your reflection can begin there.","questions":["What companionship do I want to receive today?","What aspect of my privacy do I want to protect?","What question would I like to prepare for my next conversation about care?"],"phrase":"I can choose the closeness and space I need.","suggestedIntents":["limites","pedir_apoyo","autoacogida"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"bronquiectasias","title":"Bronchiectasis","category":"Respiratory Health","aliases":["bronchiectasis","bronchial dilation","bronquiectasia","dilatacion bronquial","Bronquiectasias"],"definition":"Damage to the airways that causes them to become permanently widened. It can involve a persistent cough with mucus, repeated respiratory infections, tiredness, and difficulty breathing.","source":{"title":"Bronchiectasis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/000144.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Making room for ongoing care","reflection":"When care is a regular part of your day, you can also ask about your wishes, relationships, and small pleasures. The Flame invites you to recognize the whole person taking part in these routines and the companionship you would like to receive.","questions":["What part of the day do I want to set aside for something that matters to me?","What part of my routine would I like to share or explain?","What support helps me feel accompanied with respect?"],"phrase":"My life has room for care, relationships, and what I love.","suggestedIntents":["constancia_cuidada","pedir_apoyo","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"bulimia-nerviosa","title":"Bulimia nervosa","category":"Eating Disorders","aliases":["bulimia","Bulimia nerviosa"],"definition":"An eating disorder characterized by repeated binge-eating episodes followed by compensatory behaviors. It can affect physical health and involve intense concern about weight or body shape.","source":{"title":"Bulimia","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/000341.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Finding words for what is hard to share","reflection":"If part of your experience is hard to talk about, you can begin with a simple sentence. The Flame can be an image of acceptance as you recognize whom you want to approach. Your reflection can focus on receiving support and speaking respectfully about what you need.","questions":["What would I like to share without feeling judged?","Who can offer me a thoughtful listening ear?","What specific request would I like to bring to my support team?"],"phrase":"I can share my experience and be treated with dignity.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","compasion","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"cancer","title":"Cancer","category":"Cancer Support","aliases":["cancer","living with cancer","cancer diagnosis","proceso oncologico","diagnostico oncologico","Cáncer"],"definition":"A name for a group of diseases in which certain cells multiply uncontrollably and can invade other tissues or spread to different parts of the body.","source":{"title":"Cancer","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/cancer.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Receiving companionship on your own path","reflection":"Each person experiences this process in their own way. You can make room for the emotions that arise and the relationships you want close to you. In contemplation, the Flame can represent companionship that remains with you through uncertainty as well.","questions":["What am I feeling today, and with whom would I like to share it?","What companionship do I want to receive, and what space do I need for myself?","What question or wish do I want to express to the people supporting my care?"],"phrase":"I can receive companionship while staying true to what I feel today.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["autoacogida","pedir_apoyo","incertidumbre"]},{"id":"sindrome-tunel-carpiano","title":"Carpal tunnel syndrome","category":"Movement And Joints","aliases":["tunel carpiano","tunel carpal","compresion del nervio mediano","carpal tunnel syndrome","carpal tunnel","median nerve compression","Síndrome del túnel carpiano"],"definition":"Compression of the median nerve as it passes through the wrist, which can cause tingling, numbness, pain, or weakness in the hand and affect everyday tasks.","source":{"title":"Carpal Tunnel Syndrome","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/carpaltunnelsyndrome.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing another way of doing things","reflection":"If some tasks become difficult, you can explore what they mean to you and what help you would be willing to receive. The Flame accompanies a presence that retains its worth in every way of participating, as you discuss your pace and current possibilities.","questions":["What task that matters to me is becoming more difficult?","What help or change would I like to discuss at work or at home?","How can I recognize my worth beyond what I manage to do?"],"phrase":"My worth remains, and I can find new ways to participate.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","pedir_apoyo","limites"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"cataratas","title":"Cataracts","category":"Vision","aliases":["cataract","clouding of the lens","catarata","opacidad del cristalino","Cataratas"],"definition":"Clouding of the eye's internal lens that makes it harder for light to pass through. It can cause blurred vision, glare, or difficulty distinguishing details.","reflectionHeading":"Staying involved in everyday life","reflection":"When seeing certain details becomes difficult, it can change how you read, move around, or enjoy encounters. You can explore which activities you want to keep sharing and what help you prefer. Within the Flame framework, contemplation can draw on words or companionship without requiring clear images.","questions":["What activity matters to you to preserve or adapt?","How do you prefer to be offered help?","What form of contemplation is accessible to you without straining your eyes?"],"phrase":"My participation matters, and I can ask for my surroundings to include me.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","pedir_apoyo","expresion"],"source":{"title":"Cataracts","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/cataract.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"enfermedad-celiaca","title":"Celiac Disease","category":"Digestive Health","aliases":["celiac disease","coeliac disease","celiac sprue","celiaquia","celíaca","esprue celiaco","Enfermedad celíaca"],"definition":"A chronic immune condition in which eating gluten damages the small intestine and can make it harder to absorb the nutrients the body needs.","source":{"title":"Celiac Disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/celiacdisease.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Taking part while listening to yourself","reflection":"Sharing a table can bring together affection, traditions, and practical needs. You can contemplate the Flame as a presence that accompanies your participation: recognizing what you wish to communicate and how you would like to receive hospitality, while leaving room for your own decisions.","questions":["How would I like to explain my needs when sharing a meal?","What kind of support helps me feel included?","What can I ask for clearly without explaining my entire history?"],"phrase":"I can take part with joy and give my needs a clear place.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","limites","reciprocidad"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"cancer-cuello-uterino","title":"Cervical cancer","category":"Cancer Support","aliases":["cervical cancer","cancer of the cervix","cancer cervical","cancer de cervix","Cáncer de cuello uterino"],"definition":"Cancer that begins in the cells of the cervix, the lower part of the uterus. It usually develops gradually from cell changes that can become invasive.","source":{"title":"Cervical cancer","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/cervicalcancer.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Honoring your voice and privacy","reflection":"You can explore what information you want to share and what you want to reserve for trusted conversations. The Flame can accompany an inner presence that recognizes your dignity. Your questions about everyday life, intimacy, or the future can find room without rushing the answers.","questions":["What do I want to understand more clearly?","With whom can I speak about intimacy in confidence?","What do I want the people supporting me to keep in mind?"],"phrase":"My dignity and my voice remain present throughout this process.","suggestedIntents":["limites","confianza_discernida","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"enfermedad-renal-cronica","title":"Chronic Kidney Disease","category":"Kidney And Urinary Health","aliases":["CKD","chronic kidney disease","chronic renal insufficiency","chronic renal disease","ERC","insuficiencia renal cronica","enfermedad cronica del rinon","Enfermedad renal crónica"],"definition":"Persistent kidney damage that reduces the ability to filter blood and maintain balance in the body. It may progress slowly and affect other bodily functions.","source":{"title":"Chronic Kidney Disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/chronickidneydisease.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Sustaining your presence over time","reflection":"A prolonged health journey may invite conversations about your time, your roles, and the help you would like to receive. The Flame can symbolize the continuity of your presence: your preferences, relationships, and questions still deserve a place within your care.","questions":["What part of my life do I want to nurture alongside my health routines?","What responsibilities do I need to share?","What do I want to express to the people involved in my care?"],"phrase":"I can receive support and keep my own voice along the way.","suggestedIntents":["constancia_cuidada","reciprocidad","limites"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"epoc","title":"Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease","category":"Respiratory Health","aliases":["COPD","chronic obstructive pulmonary disease","chronic obstructive lung disease","EPOC","EOPC","enfermedad de obstruccion pulmonar cronica","Enfermedad pulmonar obstructiva crónica"],"definition":"A group of diseases that restrict airflow in the lungs and make breathing difficult. It can involve emphysema, chronic bronchitis, coughing, and fatigue during activities.","source":{"title":"Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/copd.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Participating within your current capacity","reflection":"If some activities now require a different pace, you can ask what you want to preserve in your life and what support would make participation easier. The Flame can accompany that listening as an image of presence, open to your current abilities and wishes.","questions":["What gathering or activity is still important to me?","What specific help would make it easier for me to take part?","How do I want to communicate my pace to the people close to me?"],"phrase":"I can take part at my own pace and receive support.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","expresion","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"cirrosis","title":"Cirrhosis","category":"Liver Health","aliases":["liver cirrhosis","advanced liver fibrosis","cirrosis hepatica","fibrosis hepatica avanzada","Cirrosis"],"definition":"Extensive scarring of the liver that develops after long-term injury or disease. Scar tissue replaces healthy tissue and makes it harder for the organ to function.","source":{"title":"Cirrhosis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/cirrhosis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Keeping your voice in your care","reflection":"When your health takes up more space in everyday life, you can recognize which decisions, relationships, and wishes remain important to you. The Flame can accompany your own presence, helping you formulate the questions and preferences you want to share.","questions":["What do I want others to take into account when supporting me?","What help do I want to receive, and how would I prefer to ask for it?","What relationship or activity holds special meaning for me?"],"phrase":"My voice and my preferences can be present in my care.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","pedir_apoyo","limites"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"cancer-colorrectal","title":"Colorectal cancer","category":"Cancer Support","aliases":["colon cancer","rectal cancer","colon and rectal cancer","cancer de colon","cancer de recto","cancer del colon y del recto","Cáncer colorrectal"],"definition":"Cancer that begins in the tissues of the colon or rectum, which are parts of the large intestine. The abnormal cells can grow and invade other tissues.","source":{"title":"Colon and Rectal Cancer","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/colorectalcancer.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Keeping your voice in everyday life","reflection":"When a health experience takes time and attention, you can explore which parts of everyday life you especially want to care for. The Flame can offer an image of personal continuity. You can recognize your need for privacy, prepare a conversation, and ask for help that fits your life.","questions":["What part of my routine would I like to discuss in more detail?","How would I prefer my privacy to be respected?","What support would allow me to spend time on something I value?"],"phrase":"I can protect my privacy and take part in decisions about my day.","suggestedIntents":["limites","adaptacion","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"estrenimiento","title":"Constipation","category":"Digestive Health","aliases":["constipation","difficulty passing stool","hard stools","constipacion","dificultad para evacuar","heces duras","Estreñimiento"],"definition":"Infrequent or difficult bowel movements, often involving hard, dry stools. It may occur occasionally or persist over time and can have various causes.","source":{"title":"Constipation","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/constipation.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Being patient with yourself","reflection":"You can notice how you speak to yourself when physical discomfort appears. Contemplating the Flame offers a space for patience: recognizing your experience and finding words that allow you to care for yourself with respect.","questions":["What feelings accompany this discomfort?","What would help me experience this moment with greater privacy and respect?","What question do I want to ask to better understand what is happening to me?"],"phrase":"I can treat myself patiently and express my questions.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["compasion","autoacogida","claridad"]},{"id":"enfermedad-coronaria","title":"Coronary Artery Disease","category":"Cardiovascular Health","aliases":["coronary artery disease","coronary heart disease","CAD","coronary atherosclerosis","cardiopatia coronaria","enfermedad de las arterias coronarias","EAC","arterioesclerosis coronaria","Enfermedad coronaria"],"definition":"A condition affecting the arteries that supply the heart muscle. Plaque buildup can narrow them and reduce the supply of blood and oxygen the heart needs.","source":{"title":"Coronary Artery Disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/coronaryarterydisease.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Making room for what matters to you","reflection":"Learning about a heart condition may invite you to consider how you want to spend your time and nurture your relationships. If that question arises, contemplate the Flame as a companion in recognizing your priorities and discussing the support you would like to have.","questions":["What do I want to preserve in my everyday life?","What concern would I like to share with someone who will listen?","What question do I need to clarify so I can take part in my care?"],"phrase":"I can recognize what matters to me and give it a place in my care.","suggestedIntents":["eleccion_consciente","pedir_apoyo","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"enfermedad-crohn","title":"Crohn's Disease","category":"Digestive Health","aliases":["Crohn disease","Crohn's disease","regional enteritis","Crohn","enteritis regional","Enfermedad de Crohn"],"definition":"A chronic inflammatory disease that can affect any part of the digestive tract. It often involves the small intestine and may cause abdominal pain, diarrhea, and fatigue.","source":{"title":"Crohn's Disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/crohnsdisease.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Supporting yourself through changing days","reflection":"If your capacity varies, you can explore how to arrange your relationships and plans without expecting the same response from every day. The Flame can symbolize inner continuity, helping you recognize what is available and discuss the support you would like.","questions":["What helps me when I need to change a plan?","Who would I like to tell about how I am experiencing these changes?","What part of my life do I want to keep nurturing at my own pace?"],"phrase":"I can recognize the day I have and find my own way to take part.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","compasion","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"cushing","title":"Cushing syndrome","category":"Hormonal Health","aliases":["hipercortisolismo","Cushing","Cushing syndrome","Cushing's syndrome","hypercortisolism","Síndrome de Cushing"],"definition":"A disorder caused by prolonged exposure to excessive amounts of cortisol. It may involve changes in fat distribution, muscle weakness, skin changes, and other symptoms.","source":{"title":"Cushing Syndrome","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/cushingsyndrome.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Finding yourself beyond the changes","reflection":"If physical or emotional changes affect how you recognize yourself, you can give them words and companionship. The Flame invites a broad view of your presence. Your relationships, interests, and the way you want to be heard are also part of who you are.","questions":["What aspect of my experience would I like to explain more clearly?","What part of myself do I want to keep cultivating?","What kind of company helps me feel recognized?"],"phrase":"I can meet changes with support and keep a broad view of myself.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","autoacogida","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"trombosis-venosa-profunda","title":"Deep vein thrombosis","category":"Cardiovascular Health","aliases":["TVP","trombosis venosa","flebotrombosis","deep vein thrombosis","DVT","venous thrombosis","phlebothrombosis","Trombosis venosa profunda"],"definition":"The formation of a blood clot in a deep vein, usually in the leg. The clot can obstruct circulation and, if it breaks free, travel to the lungs.","source":{"title":"Deep Vein Thrombosis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/deepveinthrombosis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Accompanying yourself through a process of care","reflection":"During follow-up care for this condition, questions may arise about what comes next and how to organize your life. The Flame offers an image of companionship for acknowledging those concerns. You can choose what you need to understand and what help you want to receive in everyday life.","questions":["What concern would I like to express during my follow-up care?","What task would be helpful to share with someone?","What helps me feel supported as I move through this process?"],"phrase":"I can give voice to my questions and receive companionship in my care.","suggestedIntents":["incertidumbre","pedir_apoyo","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"depresion","title":"Depression","category":"Mental Health","aliases":["depressive disorder","major depression","trastorno depresivo","depresion mayor","Depresión"],"definition":"A mood disorder that persistently affects feelings, thinking, and activities. It may involve loss of interest, changes in sleep, and difficulties in everyday life.","source":{"title":"Depression","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/depression.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Making room for your experience without demanding a feeling","reflection":"You can acknowledge what this day is like for you, even when words or interest are hard to find. If it feels kind, the Flame can represent a quiet companionship. One brief question or contact with someone you trust can be the focus of today's reflection.","questions":["How could I describe this day in my own words?","Who can listen to me patiently?","What practical help would be valuable today?"],"phrase":"My experience deserves to be heard on difficult days, too.","suggestedIntents":["autoacogida","compasion","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"retinopatia-diabetica","title":"Diabetic retinopathy","category":"Vision","aliases":["daño retiniano por diabetes","retinopatia por diabetes","diabetic retinopathy","diabetic retinal damage","diabetes-related retinopathy","Retinopatía diabética"],"definition":"A complication of diabetes that affects blood vessels in the retina. It can damage vision and may produce no obvious symptoms in its early stages.","reflectionHeading":"Caring for yourself without turning a diagnosis into blame","reflection":"Living with a complication may bring fatigue, fear, or difficult questions. You can attend to those emotions without turning them into a judgment of your worth. In this reflection, the Flame recalls the dignity of the person receiving care. You can also ask for help organizing conversations and decisions that feel numerous.","questions":["What emotion comes up when you talk about this complication?","What blaming message would you like to replace with more respectful treatment?","What practical help do you need to manage information and appointments?"],"phrase":"I deserve care and respect as I move through this process.","suggestedIntents":["compasion","pedir_apoyo","claridad"],"source":{"title":"Diabetic Eye Problems","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/diabeticeyeproblems.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"diverticulitis","title":"Diverticulitis","category":"Digestive Health","aliases":["inflamed diverticula","colonic diverticulitis","inflamacion de diverticulos","diverticulitis del colon","Diverticulitis"],"definition":"Inflammation of one or more small pouches that can form in the wall of the colon. It may appear suddenly and cause abdominal discomfort or other complications.","source":{"title":"Diverticulosis and Diverticulitis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/diverticulosisanddiverticulitis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Reorganizing the day with companionship","reflection":"If a health situation changes your plans, you can acknowledge the frustration, tiredness, or questions that arise. In contemplation of the Flame, you find an image for being with yourself and choosing the support you need as you reorganize everyday life.","questions":["What changed in my day, and how am I experiencing it?","What commitment do I want to discuss or reorganize?","What practical help could make this moment easier to manage?"],"phrase":"I can reorganize my plans and make room for available support.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","pedir_apoyo","descanso"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"ojo-seco","title":"Dry eye syndrome","category":"Vision","aliases":["ojo seco","sequedad ocular","queratoconjuntivitis seca","dry eye syndrome","dry eye","ocular dryness","keratoconjunctivitis sicca","Síndrome del ojo seco"],"definition":"A condition in which the surface of the eye does not maintain an adequate tear film. It can cause burning, grittiness, irritation, and blurred vision.","reflectionHeading":"Recognizing small discomforts that matter","reflection":"Discomfort that seems small to others can take up a large part of your day. You can acknowledge that impact without having to exaggerate or minimize it. The Flame is offered as an image of gentle attention; your practice can be brief and does not require looking at symbols or holding your gaze steady.","questions":["What everyday activity has become more demanding for you?","What do you need to communicate to people who expect you to carry on as usual?","What kind of pause feels gentle and within your possibilities?"],"phrase":"My discomfort deserves attention, even when other people cannot see it.","suggestedIntents":["descanso","limites","expresion"],"source":{"title":"Dry Eye Syndrome","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/000426.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"endometriosis","title":"Endometriosis","category":"Gynecological Health","aliases":["pelvic endometriosis","ovarian endometriosis","endometriosis pelvica","endometriosis ovarica","Endometriosis"],"definition":"A disease in which tissue similar to the lining inside the uterus grows outside it. It can cause pelvic pain, painful periods, and fertility problems.","source":{"title":"Endometriosis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/endometriosis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Valuing your voice","reflection":"Your experience deserves words that represent it accurately and respectfully. You can approach the Flame as a space for inner listening, where you recognize what you want to share and whom you want to invite to accompany you.","questions":["What part of my experience would I like others to understand better?","What do I need to express about my activities, relationships, or intimacy?","What question do I want to prepare for my next appointment?"],"phrase":"My experience deserves to be heard, and I can give it a voice of its own.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["expresion","dignidad","claridad"]},{"id":"epilepsia","title":"Epilepsy","category":"Neurology","aliases":["epilepsy","epileptic seizures","seizure disorder","crisis epilepticas","trastorno epileptico","Epilepsia"],"definition":"A brain disease characterized by recurrent seizures linked to abnormal electrical activity in nerve cells. Seizures may affect movement, sensations, behavior, or level of consciousness.","reflectionHeading":"Keeping your voice amid uncertainty","reflection":"The possibility of a seizure may raise questions about independence and trust. You can explore those questions without reducing your identity to a diagnosis. As an image of your dignity, the Flame invites you to recognize your preferences, relationships, and plans too, allowing support to respect your voice.","questions":["What part of your life do you want others to keep recognizing beyond the diagnosis?","What support feels respectful, and what feels intrusive?","What would you like to express about the uncertainty you are living with?"],"phrase":"My experience deserves to be heard, and my voice still matters.","suggestedIntents":["incertidumbre","expresion","limites"],"source":{"title":"Epilepsy","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/epilepsy.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"fibromialgia","title":"Fibromyalgia","category":"Persistent Pain","aliases":["fibromyalgia","chronic fibromyalgia","fibro fog","fibromialgia cronica","fibroniebla","Fibromialgia"],"definition":"A chronic condition characterized by widespread body pain and fatigue. It may also involve sleep problems and difficulties with concentration or memory.","source":{"title":"Fibromyalgia","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/fibromyalgia.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing the experience others cannot see","reflection":"You can find words for what you are living through, even when it is hard to explain. The Flame offers an image of inner recognition: welcoming your experience, identifying what you need, and choosing whom to share it with.","questions":["What am I finding difficult to explain?","What specific help would meet my needs today?","How do I want to support myself when my energy changes?"],"phrase":"I can recognize my experience and ask for companionship that suits me.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["expresion","dignidad","pedir_apoyo"]},{"id":"gripe","title":"Flu","category":"Infections","aliases":["flu","influenza","seasonal flu","gripa","trancazo","Gripe"],"definition":"A respiratory infection caused by influenza viruses. It can cause fever, cough, muscle aches, and fatigue, with severity that varies from person to person.","source":{"title":"Flu","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/flu.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Making space in your day","reflection":"A sudden change in your capacity can show how much your day depended on being available. You can contemplate the Flame as an invitation to recognize your current needs, rearrange commitments, and simply receive the help that others can offer.","questions":["What commitment do I need to rearrange today?","What task can I share or leave for another time?","How do I want to speak to myself while my capacity is different?"],"phrase":"I can rearrange my day with clarity and kindness.","suggestedIntents":["descanso","compasion","limites"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"alergia-alimentaria","title":"Food allergy","category":"Allergies","aliases":["food allergies","allergy to food","alergia a los alimentos","alergia a las comidas","Alergia alimentaria"],"definition":"An immune system reaction to particular foods that it mistakenly recognizes as harmful. Its effects can involve different parts of the body and vary in intensity.","source":{"title":"Food allergy","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/foodallergy.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Belonging while keeping your voice","reflection":"Gatherings around food can raise questions about belonging, communication, and care. You can contemplate the Flame as a presence that supports your right to express your needs and participate in a way that respects the arrangements you have made to care for yourself.","questions":["How do I want to express my needs at a shared gathering?","What helps me feel included and respected?","What conversation beforehand would make it easier for me to take part?"],"phrase":"I can take part and clearly express what I need.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","limites","apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"calculos-biliares","title":"Gallstones","category":"Digestive Health","aliases":["gallstones","cholelithiasis","biliary stones","piedras en la vesicula","colelitiasis","litiasis biliar","Cálculos biliares"],"definition":"Solid deposits that form when certain substances in bile harden. They may cause no symptoms or block the ducts through which bile flows.","source":{"title":"Gallstones","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/gallstones.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Making room to understand","reflection":"News about your health can bring worry, questions, or a wish to reorganize your plans. You can contemplate the Flame as companionship while distinguishing what you know, what you need to ask, and which decision still needs time to be understood.","questions":["What do I feel when I think about this situation?","What information do I have, and what do I want to ask?","Who could accompany me in a conversation that matters to me?"],"phrase":"I can give my questions time and receive companionship as I seek to understand.","suggestedIntents":["claridad","incertidumbre","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"gastritis","title":"Gastritis","category":"Digestive Health","aliases":["gastritis","acute gastritis","chronic gastritis","stomach inflammation","gastritis aguda","gastritis cronica","inflamacion del estomago","Gastritis"],"definition":"Inflammation of the stomach lining that may last briefly or persist for months or years. Some people experience discomfort, while others have no symptoms.","source":{"title":"Gastritis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/001150.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Putting your questions into words","reflection":"When discomfort appears, you may need words to describe it and questions to understand what you are experiencing. The Flame can accompany that simple listening: observing your experience, recognizing your concerns, and giving them a place in a conversation about your care.","questions":["What would I like to understand better about my experience?","What question have I been putting off asking?","How can I speak kindly to myself while seeking answers?"],"phrase":"I can listen to my questions and express them clearly.","suggestedIntents":["claridad","expresion","compasion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"reflujo","title":"Gastroesophageal reflux","category":"Digestive Health","aliases":["ERGE","RGE","acidez cronica","reflujo acido","gastroesophageal reflux","GERD","GER","acid reflux","chronic heartburn","Reflujo gastroesofágico"],"definition":"The return of stomach contents into the esophagus, which can cause heartburn or regurgitation. When persistent or damaging, it may constitute gastroesophageal reflux disease.","source":{"title":"Gastroesophageal Reflux","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/gerd.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Giving words to your experience","reflection":"Recurring discomfort can take up space in your day. You can listen to how you are experiencing it and recognize what you need to feel supported. The Flame invites you to hold that inner conversation with respect and simplicity.","questions":["How is this experience affecting my activities?","What do I need to explain more clearly?","What act of kindness can I offer myself today?"],"phrase":"I can name my experience and receive it with respect.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["expresion","compasion","autoacogida"]},{"id":"ansiedad-generalizada","title":"Generalized anxiety disorder","category":"Mental Health","aliases":["TAG","ansiedad generalizada","generalized anxiety disorder","GAD","generalized anxiety","Trastorno de ansiedad generalizada"],"definition":"A disorder characterized by persistent, hard-to-control worry about various everyday matters. It may involve restlessness, muscle tension, difficulty concentrating, and sleep disturbances.","source":{"title":"Generalized Anxiety Disorder","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/000917.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Making room for one specific concern","reflection":"If worries take up a lot of space, you can choose one small experience to name. The Flame can be an image of companionship during that conversation with yourself. Perhaps today you want to identify a specific question, recognize a source of support, or share how you are experiencing the day.","questions":["What worry would I like to express in simple words?","What part of this situation can I discuss with someone?","What support would I like to receive today?"],"phrase":"I can approach one question at a time.","suggestedIntents":["claridad","expresion","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"diabetes-gestacional","title":"Gestational diabetes","category":"Metabolic Health","aliases":["diabetes in pregnancy","diabetes during pregnancy","gestational diabetes","diabetes del embarazo","diabetes durante el embarazo","Diabetes gestacional"],"definition":"Diabetes that develops during pregnancy when insulin production does not meet the body's additional needs. It is marked by elevated blood glucose levels.","source":{"title":"Diabetes and Pregnancy","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/diabetesandpregnancy.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Receiving companionship through a time of change","reflection":"During pregnancy, you may experience different emotions as you incorporate new aspects of care. Allow yourself to recognize them in your own words. The Flame can accompany a space of tenderness where you express questions, share tasks, and listen to what support you want to receive at this stage.","questions":["What emotion needs room to be heard today?","What question do I want to bring to my next appointment?","What task or concern would I like to share?"],"phrase":"I can move through this stage with tenderness, questions, and companionship.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","pedir_apoyo","compasion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"glaucoma","title":"Glaucoma","category":"Vision","aliases":["glaucoma","open-angle glaucoma","angle-closure glaucoma","glaucoma de angulo abierto","glaucoma de angulo cerrado","Glaucoma"],"definition":"A group of diseases that damage the optic nerve and can reduce vision. Some forms progress without noticeable symptoms at first and are detected through eye examinations.","reflectionHeading":"Meeting uncertainty with clarity","reflection":"A diagnosis may bring questions even when you notice no change in your vision. You can make room for concern and prepare what you need to understand. As a contemplative symbol, the Flame accompanies your relationship with that uncertainty; it cannot measure the disease or predict how it will progress.","questions":["What question would you like to bring to your next conversation with your health care team?","Who can help you organize the information you receive?","What do you need today to feel supported without having your concerns minimized?"],"phrase":"I can seek clear information and receive support one step at a time.","suggestedIntents":["incertidumbre","claridad","pedir_apoyo"],"source":{"title":"Glaucoma","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/glaucoma.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"gota","title":"Gout","category":"Movement And Joints","aliases":["gout","gouty arthritis","gout flare","artritis gotosa","crisis de gota","Gota"],"definition":"A form of inflammatory arthritis related to deposits of urate crystals in the joints. It can cause episodes of intense pain, swelling, and redness, often in the foot.","source":{"title":"Gout","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/gout.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Supporting yourself when your day is interrupted","reflection":"A painful episode can change your plans and bring frustration. If that happens, you can acknowledge your feelings without rushing to fix them. The Flame offers an image of companionship for expressing needs, reconsidering commitments, and receiving help as you navigate that change in your day.","questions":["What do I feel when I have to change my plans?","What commitment do I need to renegotiate?","What specific help would make my day more manageable?"],"phrase":"I can acknowledge my frustration and communicate what I need today.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","apoyo","compasion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"graves","title":"Graves' Disease","category":"Hormonal Health","aliases":["Graves disease","Graves' disease","Graves-Basedow disease","diffuse toxic goiter","Graves Basedow","enfermedad de Basedow","bocio toxico difuso","Enfermedad de Graves"],"definition":"An autoimmune disease that stimulates the thyroid gland and causes excessive hormone production. It may also involve changes in the eyes and, less often, the skin.","source":{"title":"Graves' Disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/000358.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Seeing yourself more fully through change","reflection":"If you notice changes affecting how you feel or how others see you, you can explore what living through them means to you. The image of the Flame invites you to recognize your dignity. Listen to what you want to share, what you prefer to keep private, and what companionship feels respectful.","questions":["Which change is affecting me most personally?","What kinds of comments or companionship help me feel respected?","What do I want to communicate about my experience?"],"phrase":"I can view my experience more fully and choose how to share it.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","expresion","limites"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"hashimoto","title":"Hashimoto thyroiditis","category":"Hormonal Health","aliases":["enfermedad de Hashimoto","tiroiditis cronica","Hashimoto","Hashimoto thyroiditis","Hashimoto's thyroiditis","Hashimoto disease","chronic thyroiditis","Tiroiditis de Hashimoto"],"definition":"An autoimmune disorder in which the immune system affects the thyroid gland. It often reduces the gland’s hormone production and leads to hypothyroidism over time.","source":{"title":"Chronic Thyroiditis (Hashimoto Disease)","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/000371.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Cultivating a patient relationship with yourself","reflection":"You can ask how you are experiencing changes in energy, appointments, or waiting for answers. The Flame can represent a patient presence as you come to understand your process. Recognize what you know today and what you want to discuss, leaving room for your feelings.","questions":["What am I learning from my everyday experience?","What question remains open for me?","How do I want to support myself as I continue my follow-up care?"],"phrase":"I can accompany my process with patience and questions of my own.","suggestedIntents":["compasion","constancia_cuidada","claridad"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"perdida-audicion","title":"Hearing loss","category":"Hearing And Balance","aliases":["hipoacusia","perdida auditiva","sordera","hearing loss","deafness","hypoacusis","hearing impairment","Pérdida de audición"],"definition":"A partial or complete reduction in the ability to hear, with varying degrees and causes. It can affect the perception of sounds and access to conversations.","reflectionHeading":"Participating in your own way of communicating","reflection":"Your sense of belonging does not depend on hearing in a particular way. You can choose forms of communication that are accessible to you and ask that others respect them. In the language of the Flame, shared presence can be expressed through writing, signing, images, or words, according to your preferences.","questions":["What form of communication do you prefer in this interaction?","What change would help you participate more comfortably?","What would you like people to understand about your identity and preferences?"],"phrase":"My way of communicating deserves room, access, and respect.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","adaptacion","limites"],"source":{"title":"Hearing Disorders and Deafness","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/hearingdisordersanddeafness.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"insuficiencia-cardiaca","title":"Heart Failure","category":"Cardiovascular Health","aliases":["heart failure","congestive heart failure","CHF","cardiac failure","fallo cardiaco","insuficiencia cardiaca congestiva","ICC","Insuficiencia cardíaca"],"definition":"A condition in which the heart does not pump enough blood to meet the body's needs. It may involve muscle weakness or difficulty filling adequately.","source":{"title":"Heart Failure","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/heartfailure.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Taking part at your own pace","reflection":"If your activities need adjustments, you can explore which ways of taking part remain meaningful to you. In the image of the Flame, your presence retains its dignity. You can listen to sadness about what is changing and recognize the companionship you wish to receive.","questions":["What activity holds special value for me?","What change in my life do I need to discuss?","What help would allow me to take part more comfortably?"],"phrase":"My presence has value, and I can receive help that suits me.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","pedir_apoyo","tristeza"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"hemorroides","title":"Hemorrhoids","category":"Digestive Health","aliases":["hemorrhoids","haemorrhoids","piles","internal hemorrhoids","external hemorrhoids","almorranas","hemorroides internas","hemorroides externas","Hemorroides"],"definition":"Swollen veins in the anal area or lower rectum. They may be internal or external and can cause itching, discomfort, or bleeding.","source":{"title":"Hemorrhoids","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/hemorrhoids.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Bringing dignity to what is hard to name","reflection":"Some kinds of discomfort can feel awkward to discuss. You can contemplate the Flame as a respectful presence while finding simple words to describe your experience. Your privacy can coexist with the freedom to ask questions and receive the attention you seek.","questions":["What am I finding hard to name about this experience?","What do I need to feel comfortable asking for guidance?","What simple words would help me explain my need?"],"phrase":"I can speak about my body respectfully and protect my privacy.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","expresion","compasion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"hepatitis-b","title":"Hepatitis B","category":"Liver Health","aliases":["hepatitis B","HBV","chronic hepatitis B","acute hepatitis B","VHB","hepatitis B cronica","hepatitis B aguda","Hepatitis B"],"definition":"A liver infection caused by the hepatitis B virus. It may be brief or persistent and can affect liver function in different ways.","source":{"title":"Hepatitis B","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/hepatitisb.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Choosing how you want to be supported","reflection":"You can explore whom you want to talk with about your experience and what you need from that conversation. The Flame can symbolize an inner space of dignity from which you recognize your questions, choose your words, and seek relationships where you feel respected.","questions":["What do I want to share about what I am experiencing?","What response would help me feel supported and respected?","What information do I need to have a clearer conversation?"],"phrase":"My experience deserves respect, and I can choose how to share it.","suggestedIntents":["limites","confianza_discernida","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"hepatitis-c","title":"Hepatitis C","category":"Liver Health","aliases":["hepatitis C","HCV","chronic hepatitis C","acute hepatitis C","VHC","hepatitis C cronica","hepatitis C aguda","Hepatitis C"],"definition":"An infection caused by the hepatitis C virus that inflames the liver. It can be short-lived or persist and cause liver damage over time.","source":{"title":"Hepatitis C","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/hepatitisc.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Finding words without judging yourself","reflection":"Questions about a health condition can coexist with many different emotions. You can approach the Flame as an image of acceptance while naming what you feel, recognizing your needs, and deciding what companionship would be valuable to you during this process.","questions":["What emotion do I want to be able to name freely?","With whom do I feel heard without having to defend myself?","What question do I want to bring to my next conversation about care?"],"phrase":"I can express my experience and be heard with respect.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","autoacogida","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"colesterol-alto","title":"High cholesterol","category":"Metabolic Health","aliases":["hypercholesterolemia","high LDL","elevated cholesterol","hipercolesterolemia","LDL alto","colesterol elevado","Colesterol alto"],"definition":"Elevated levels of certain fats in the blood, especially LDL cholesterol. Excess amounts can contribute to plaque buildup in the arteries and increase cardiovascular risk.","source":{"title":"Cholesterol","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/cholesterol.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Finding meaning in continuity","reflection":"A laboratory result can raise questions about the future and everyday care. You can approach those questions with curiosity. In the vision of the Flame, an intention can find expression in small commitments you choose to understand and sustain with support.","questions":["What do I want to understand about my results?","What makes it easier to sustain my care commitments?","What support can I ask for to help me get organized?"],"phrase":"I can understand my care and sustain it through steps I choose.","suggestedIntents":["constancia_cuidada","integracion_cotidiana","claridad"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"vih","title":"HIV","category":"Infections","aliases":["virus de inmunodeficiencia humana","infeccion por VIH","HIV","human immunodeficiency virus","HIV infection","VIH"],"definition":"A virus that affects the immune system by damaging cells involved in defending against infection. HIV infection and AIDS describe different situations.","source":{"title":"HIV","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/hiv.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Choosing how you share your experience","reflection":"Your experience can have the place and privacy you choose. In contemplation of the Flame, you can recognize your dignity, the relationships that support you, and the conversations you want to open, preserving your voice in decisions about your life.","questions":["With whom do I feel respected and heard?","What do I want to share, and what would I prefer to keep private?","What support would help with a project that matters to me?"],"phrase":"My dignity remains, and I can choose how I share my life.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","limites","confianza_discernida"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"urticaria","title":"Hives","category":"Skin","aliases":["ronchas","habones","hives","urticaria","welts","wheals","Urticaria"],"definition":"Raised welts that appear on the skin, often with itching. They can arise from different triggers and change shape or location over time.","source":{"title":"Hives","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/hives.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Meeting the moment with kindness","reflection":"If discomfort occupies your attention, you can recognize how it is affecting your mood and plans. The Flame can represent a kind space in which to put your experience into words and choose what company or privacy you would like to have.","questions":["What emotion accompanies this discomfort?","What do I want to communicate about how I am today?","Would I prefer company, privacy, or practical help right now?"],"phrase":"I can recognize what I feel and choose how to support myself.","suggestedIntents":["compasion","expresion","apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"hipertension","title":"Hypertension","category":"Cardiovascular Health","aliases":["hypertension","high blood pressure","elevated blood pressure","presion arterial alta","tension alta","alta presion","Hipertensión"],"definition":"Persistently elevated pressure exerted by blood against the arteries. It often goes unnoticed because it causes no symptoms and is identified through measurements and professional assessment.","source":{"title":"High Blood Pressure","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/highbloodpressure.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Being present in everyday care","reflection":"Living with a condition that requires follow-up can raise questions about care and continuity. The Flame can accompany you as an image of presence: attending to daily life, recognizing your resources, and asking for the support you choose.","questions":["How am I experiencing the care of my health?","What helps me sustain my daily commitments?","What question do I want to bring to my next conversation with my care team?"],"phrase":"I can maintain my care with presence and support.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["constancia_cuidada","pedir_apoyo","claridad"]},{"id":"hipertiroidismo","title":"Hyperthyroidism","category":"Hormonal Health","aliases":["hyperthyroidism","overactive thyroid","thyroid overactivity","tiroides hiperactiva","hiperfuncion tiroidea","hipertireosis","Hipertiroidismo"],"definition":"Production of more thyroid hormones than the body needs. This can speed up various bodily functions and may involve palpitations, weight loss, or intolerance to heat.","source":{"title":"Hyperthyroidism","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/hyperthyroidism.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Distinguishing and naming your experience","reflection":"When your bodily experience feels different, you can take time to recognize what you are living through and how it affects you. The Flame accompanies listening without rushing to explain everything. A question, a need for rest, or a conversation you want to prepare may emerge.","questions":["What change in my experience am I finding difficult to describe?","What would I like other people to understand?","What part of my day needs a gentler way of being organized?"],"phrase":"I can describe what I am living through and find words for my needs.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","descanso","claridad"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"hipotiroidismo","title":"Hypothyroidism","category":"Hormonal Health","aliases":["hypothyroidism","underactive thyroid","thyroid underactivity","thyroid insufficiency","tiroides hipoactiva","hipofuncion tiroidea","insuficiencia tiroidea","Hipotiroidismo"],"definition":"A condition in which the thyroid produces fewer hormones than the body needs. This can slow various bodily functions and affect available energy.","source":{"title":"Hypothyroidism","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/hypothyroidism.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Listening to today's capacity","reflection":"You can ask what pace you are able to sustain and which expectations deserve a conversation. The Flame accompanies a presence attentive to practical realities: your resources, your time, and the help you would like to receive.","questions":["What am I able to do today?","What expectation would I like to reconsider kindly?","What help would make a task I care about easier?"],"phrase":"I can recognize my capacity and choose a step that fits me.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","pedir_apoyo","compasion"]},{"id":"infertilidad","title":"Infertility","category":"Reproductive Health","aliases":["infertility","difficulty conceiving","problems conceiving","sterility","problemas para concebir","esterilidad","Infertilidad"],"definition":"Difficulty achieving a pregnancy after a period of regular sexual intercourse without contraception. It may involve factors affecting either partner.","source":{"title":"Infertility","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/infertility.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Making room for your wishes and your boundaries","reflection":"You can explore how your wishes, expectations, and other people’s questions coexist. The Flame can represent a private space in which to recognize your experience respectfully. You decide which conversations to open, what boundaries to express, and what companionship you want while navigating uncertainty.","questions":["What wish do I want to hear in my own words?","Which questions from other people would I prefer to leave unanswered?","What companionship recognizes my experience without rushing it?"],"phrase":"My wishes, emotions, and boundaries deserve respect.","suggestedIntents":["autoacogida","limites","tristeza"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"insomnio","title":"Insomnia","category":"Sleep","aliases":["insomnia","difficulty sleeping","can't sleep","cannot sleep","nighttime awakenings","dificultad para dormir","no puedo dormir","despertares nocturnos","Insomnio"],"definition":"Difficulty falling asleep or staying asleep, or waking earlier than desired. It can leave you feeling insufficiently rested and affect your functioning during the day.","source":{"title":"Insomnia","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/insomnia.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Making space for the night","reflection":"When rest becomes difficult, you can approach the night with curiosity and tenderness. The Flame offers an image of inner companionship: a place to recognize how you arrive at the end of the day and what you would like to receive in this moment.","questions":["What am I feeling while I wait for sleep?","What matter would I like to write down and return to tomorrow?","What kind of companionship or quiet inward attention would feel kind tonight?"],"phrase":"I can be tender with myself as I find my own rhythm.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["descanso","autoacogida","claridad"]},{"id":"cistitis-intersticial","title":"Interstitial cystitis","category":"Kidney And Urinary Health","aliases":["painful bladder syndrome","chronic bladder pain","sindrome de vejiga dolorosa","dolor vesical cronico","Cistitis intersticial"],"definition":"A persistent condition that can cause bladder pain or discomfort and a frequent or urgent need to urinate. The intensity and combination of symptoms vary between people.","source":{"title":"Interstitial cystitis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/interstitialcystitis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Finding words for a persistent experience","reflection":"If it is hard to explain what you are going through, you can begin with one specific need today. In contemplation, the Flame offers an image of inner recognition: receiving your experience and choosing what you want to communicate about your activities, relationships, or intimacy.","questions":["What part of my experience is proving difficult to explain?","What do I need to discuss about my activities or intimacy?","Who could support me by listening to what I consider important?"],"phrase":"My experience can find words and companionship that respects it.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","autoacogida","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"anemia-ferropenica","title":"Iron deficiency anemia","category":"Blood","aliases":["iron-deficiency anemia","anemia caused by iron deficiency","anemia por deficiencia de hierro","anemia por falta de hierro","Anemia ferropénica"],"definition":"A type of anemia related to insufficient iron to produce hemoglobin. It can reduce oxygen transport and may be accompanied by tiredness, weakness, or paleness.","source":{"title":"Iron deficiency anemia","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/000584.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing the energy available to you","reflection":"If tiredness changes what you can do, you can acknowledge it without measuring your worth by productivity. The image of the Flame accompanies a presence that deserves to be heard. Ask what you need to adjust, what you can share, and which expectations you would like to reconsider kindly.","questions":["What task is taking more effort than usual?","What expectation can I reconsider for now?","Who could help me with something specific?"],"phrase":"My worth remains, and I can recognize the energy available to me today.","suggestedIntents":["descanso","compasion","apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"intestino-irritable","title":"Irritable bowel syndrome","category":"Digestive Health","aliases":["SII","IBS","colon irritable","irritable bowel syndrome","irritable colon","Síndrome del intestino irritable"],"definition":"A group of symptoms combining recurrent abdominal pain with changes in bowel movements, such as diarrhea, constipation, or both, without visible damage explaining those symptoms.","source":{"title":"Definition and Facts for Irritable Bowel Syndrome","url":"https://www.niddk.nih.gov/health-information/informacion-de-la-salud/enfermedades-digestivas/sindrome-intestino-irritable/definicion-hechos","organization":"NIDDK · National Institutes of Health","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Keeping room for your life","reflection":"When your physical experience changes from day to day, you can ask how to keep room for your relationships, projects, and privacy. The Flame accompanies the possibility of recognizing your needs and making them part of your decisions.","questions":["What aspect of my life would I like to keep cultivating?","What do I need to talk about to feel more supported?","What can I choose today without demanding that I solve everything at once?"],"phrase":"My needs can have a place in my decisions.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","eleccion_consciente","expresion"]},{"id":"calculos-renales","title":"Kidney stones","category":"Kidney And Urinary Health","aliases":["renal stones","renal calculi","nephrolithiasis","piedras en los rinones","litiasis renal","nefrolitiasis","Cálculos renales"],"definition":"Solid formations that develop in the kidneys from substances present in urine. They can move through the urinary tract and cause blockage or pain.","source":{"title":"Kidney stones","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/kidneystones.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Listening to your needs when life is interrupted","reflection":"When a physical experience interrupts your activities, you can explore what you need to feel accompanied. The Flame can be an image of inner closeness as you recognize your emotions, formulate a question, and decide what practical help to request from those available.","questions":["What do I need someone to understand about this moment?","What question would help me make sense of my concern?","What task or commitment can I share with another person?"],"phrase":"I can name what I need and allow others to accompany me.","suggestedIntents":["apoyo","claridad","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"leucemia","title":"Leukemia","category":"Cancer Support","aliases":["leukemia","leukaemia","acute leukemia","chronic leukemia","cancer","leucemia aguda","leucemia cronica","cáncer","Leucemia"],"definition":"Cancer of the blood cells that begins in blood-forming tissues, such as bone marrow. Abnormal cells can crowd out healthy cells.","source":{"title":"Leukemia","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/leukemia.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing your network of support","reflection":"You can notice who takes part in your day and what help feels most valuable. The image of the Flame can represent a presence expressed through tangible relationships too. You may want to name a need, appreciate someone’s companionship, or keep a moment for yourself.","questions":["What specific help do I need this week?","How would I like to organize visits or messages?","What small personal space would I like to preserve?"],"phrase":"I can receive help and keep a space of my own.","suggestedIntents":["pedir_apoyo","reciprocidad","limites"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"covid-persistente","title":"Long COVID","category":"Post-Infectious Conditions","aliases":["long COVID","post-COVID conditions","post-COVID-19 conditions","COVID prolongado","afecciones posteriores al COVID-19","COVID persistente"],"definition":"A group of health problems that continue or appear after a coronavirus infection. They can include fatigue, cognitive difficulties, and other symptoms that fluctuate.","source":{"title":"Post-COVID Conditions (Long COVID)","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/postcovidconditionslongcovid.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing a changing experience","reflection":"If what you can do fluctuates, you can find words to describe the day you are actually living. The Flame can accompany you as an image of recognition, making room for your experience and your need to be heard without having to prove your effort.","questions":["What has changed today compared with other days?","What do I need others to understand about what I can currently do?","Who can support me in expressing a specific need?"],"phrase":"My experience deserves to be heard, even when it changes.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","adaptacion","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"dolor-lumbar","title":"Low back pain","category":"Movement And Joints","aliases":["lumbago","lower back pain","chronic low back pain","lumbalgia","dolor de espalda baja","dolor lumbar cronico","Dolor lumbar"],"definition":"Pain in the lower back, between the lower ribs and the buttocks. It may be brief or persistent and can limit everyday movement.","source":{"title":"Low back pain","url":"https://www.who.int/es/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/low-back-pain","organization":"World Health Organization","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing the support available","reflection":"If pain changes how you take part in the day, you can explore what help you find valuable. The Flame can symbolize a presence accompanying your actual life, including your decisions about time, companionship, and activities.","questions":["What activity is becoming harder to sustain?","What practical help would I like to ask for?","What part of me needs to be heard today?"],"phrase":"I can recognize my support and give voice to my needs.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["pedir_apoyo","adaptacion","expresion"]},{"id":"cancer-pulmon","title":"Lung cancer","category":"Cancer Support","aliases":["lung cancer","pulmonary cancer","bronchopulmonary carcinoma","cancer pulmonar","carcinoma broncopulmonar","Cáncer de pulmón"],"definition":"Cancer that forms in lung tissue, usually in the cells lining the airways. Its main groups are small cell and non-small cell lung cancer.","source":{"title":"Lung cancer","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/lungcancer.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Receiving companionship without explaining everything","reflection":"You can choose how you want to be heard during this process. The image of the Flame can represent companionship that recognizes the whole person, with their history, relationships, and wishes. Perhaps today you want to share an emotion or ask for a simple, close presence.","questions":["What emotion would I like to share today?","What comment would I prefer to hear expressed differently?","What kind of companionship feels valuable to me right now?"],"phrase":"I deserve companionship that receives me with respect.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","compasion","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"lupus","title":"Lupus","category":"Autoimmune Conditions","aliases":["lupus","systemic lupus erythematosus","SLE","cutaneous lupus","lupus eritematoso sistemico","LES","lupus cutaneo","Lupus"],"definition":"A chronic autoimmune disease in which the immune system causes inflammation and can affect healthy tissues. Its manifestations vary and may involve different organs.","source":{"title":"Lupus","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/lupus.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Listening to the day you are living","reflection":"You can recognize your capacity today and what you want to preserve in your relationships and activities. The Flame accompanies that attention to the present as an image of companionship: finding words for your experience and allowing your needs to take part in decisions.","questions":["What is possible for me today?","What do I need to adjust or discuss in my commitments?","Who could help me with a specific task?"],"phrase":"I can listen to my present experience and make room for my needs.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","expresion","limites"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"linfoma","title":"Lymphoma","category":"Cancer Support","aliases":["lymphoma","Hodgkin lymphoma","non-Hodgkin lymphoma","cancer","linfoma de Hodgkin","linfoma no Hodgkin","cáncer","Linfoma"],"definition":"A group of cancers affecting the lymphatic system and immune cells called lymphocytes. It includes Hodgkin lymphoma and various non-Hodgkin lymphomas.","source":{"title":"Lymphoma","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/lymphoma.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Making room for different questions","reflection":"A health journey can bring together practical questions, emotions, and wishes that change over time. You can approach each one patiently. The Flame can accompany that inner listening as you distinguish what you need to understand, what you want to share, and what companionship you wish to receive today.","questions":["What question matters most to me now?","What emotion would I like to be able to name?","Whom can I ask for specific help?"],"phrase":"I can recognize what I need in this moment.","suggestedIntents":["incertidumbre","claridad","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"degeneracion-macular","title":"Macular degeneration","category":"Vision","aliases":["degeneration of the macula","AMD","age-related macular degeneration","degeneracion de la macula","DMAE","degeneracion macular relacionada con la edad","Degeneración macular"],"definition":"A disease affecting the macula, the area of the retina responsible for detailed central vision. It can make recognizing faces, reading, and distinguishing details of objects difficult.","reflectionHeading":"Continuing to find ways to connect","reflection":"Changes in central vision can touch cherished activities and ways of relating to others. There is room to miss what is changing and choose other forms of connection. The Flame can be evoked through a word or shared intention; you do not need to picture it mentally to participate.","questions":["What activity or encounter do you miss and want to adapt?","What other forms of contact feel valuable to you?","What emotion about these changes needs to be heard without being rushed?"],"phrase":"I can seek new ways to connect without denying what I miss.","suggestedIntents":["tristeza","adaptacion","expresion"],"source":{"title":"Macular degeneration","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/maculardegeneration.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"melanoma","title":"Melanoma","category":"Cancer Support","aliases":["melanoma","cutaneous melanoma","cancer","melanoma cutaneo","cáncer","Melanoma"],"definition":"A type of skin cancer that may appear in an existing mole or as a new lesion. It can change in size, shape, color, or texture.","source":{"title":"Melanoma","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/melanoma.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Making space for what you feel while waiting","reflection":"If appointments or results raise questions about the future, you can recognize how you are experiencing the wait. The Flame can symbolize companionship in the present moment. Your reflection may focus on an emotion, a conversation still to be had, or a relationship you would like close by.","questions":["What do I feel while waiting for an answer?","What question do I want to prepare?","What person or activity would I like to keep in mind today?"],"phrase":"I can receive companionship while giving my questions time.","suggestedIntents":["incertidumbre","autoacogida","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"migrana","title":"Migraine","category":"Neurology","aliases":["migraine","migraine headache","jaqueca","migraña","Migraña"],"definition":"A disorder with recurrent episodes of headache, often throbbing and moderate or severe, that may be accompanied by nausea and sensitivity to light or sound.","source":{"title":"Migraine","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/migraine.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Respecting the experience you are living through","reflection":"If a migraine changes your day, you can recognize how it affects you and what you need to communicate. In contemplation, the Flame can represent a quiet presence that allows you to be with yourself at your own pace.","questions":["What emotion arises when I have to change my plans?","What do I need those supporting me to understand?","What expectation can I reconsider kindly today?"],"phrase":"My experience deserves to be heard, and my pace deserves respect.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","expresion","compasion"]},{"id":"esclerosis-multiple","title":"Multiple Sclerosis","category":"Neurology","aliases":["MS","multiple sclerosis","relapsing-remitting multiple sclerosis","EM","esclerosis multiple recurrente remitente","Esclerosis múltiple"],"definition":"A disease of the central nervous system that damages the protective myelin around nerve fibers. It can disrupt communication between the brain and body in various ways.","reflectionHeading":"Making room for different kinds of days","reflection":"If your capacity changes from day to day, you may need to reconsider expectations without feeling that you are letting yourself down. You can contemplate the Flame as a presence alongside those changes. Naming what you need today opens conversations about support, boundaries, and choices that still hold meaning for you.","questions":["What do you need others to understand about your different kinds of days?","What expectation would you like to reconsider with more kindness?","What choice is still yours to make today?"],"phrase":"I can listen to today's needs without comparing them with yesterday's.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","limites","pedir_apoyo"],"source":{"title":"Multiple Sclerosis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/multiplesclerosis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"em-sfc","title":"Myalgic encephalomyelitis / chronic fatigue syndrome","category":"Persistent Fatigue","aliases":["ME/CFS","chronic fatigue syndrome","myalgic encephalomyelitis","EM/SFC","sindrome de fatiga cronica","encefalomielitis mialgica","Encefalomielitis miálgica / síndrome de fatiga crónica"],"definition":"A long-term illness involving disabling fatigue, unrefreshing sleep, and worsening after exertion. It can affect thinking, memory, and the ability to tolerate being upright.","source":{"title":"Myalgic Encephalomyelitis/Chronic Fatigue Syndrome","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/myalgicencephalomyelitischronicfatiguesyndrome.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing the value of your presence","reflection":"You can explore what kind of contact and companionship fits what is possible for you today. You may choose to receive the image of the Flame in a brief, simple way. Your presence remains valuable when activities change and you need others to understand your limits.","questions":["What kind of companionship fits the energy available to me?","What boundary do I need to communicate to feel respected?","What practical help can I ask for without having to explain everything again?"],"phrase":"My presence has value, and my limits deserve to be heard.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","limites","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"enfermedad-meniere","title":"Ménière's Disease","category":"Hearing And Balance","aliases":["Meniere's disease","Meniere disease","Ménière's disease","Meniere syndrome","Meniere","sindrome de Meniere","Enfermedad de Ménière"],"definition":"An inner ear disorder that can cause episodes of vertigo, hearing changes, tinnitus, and a feeling of pressure in the ear. Its course varies between people.","source":{"title":"Ménière's Disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/menieresdisease.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Keeping a sense of support","reflection":"When changes in hearing or balance affect your plans, you can explore what arrangements would help you feel supported. The Flame can symbolize a calm presence during a comfortable moment. You may want to express a need, adjust a meeting, or share what concerns you.","questions":["What do I need others to understand when my plans change?","What practical arrangement would give me more support?","What do I want to keep sharing with people close to me?"],"phrase":"I can ask for arrangements that support my everyday life.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","apoyo","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"narcolepsia","title":"Narcolepsy","category":"Sleep","aliases":["trastorno narcoleptico","narcolepsia tipo 1","narcolepsia tipo 2","narcolepsy","narcoleptic disorder","type 1 narcolepsy","type 2 narcolepsy","Narcolepsia"],"definition":"A neurological disorder affecting the regulation of sleep and wakefulness. It causes intense daytime sleepiness and sleep episodes, and sometimes a sudden loss of muscle tone.","reflectionHeading":"Being understood without having to justify yourself","reflection":"It can be painful when others mistake your sleepiness for a lack of interest. You can explore what explanation you want to share and what respect you need in your relationships. The Flame can represent your enduring personal worth, even when your waking hours do not match other people’s expectations.","questions":["Where do you feel your experience is being misunderstood?","What boundary would help you feel that you are being treated with respect?","Who can you talk with about the adjustments you need in daily life?"],"phrase":"My need for support does not diminish my commitment or my worth.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","dignidad","limites"],"source":{"title":"Narcolepsy","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/000802.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"obesidad","title":"Obesity","category":"Metabolic Health","aliases":["adiposidad excesiva","obesidad abdominal","obesity","excess adiposity","abdominal obesity","Obesidad"],"definition":"A condition characterized by an excessive amount of body fat that can affect health. Multiple biological, environmental, and social factors contribute; assessment considers each person’s circumstances.","source":{"title":"Obesity","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/obesity.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing your dignity in care","reflection":"You can notice how comments, expectations, and experiences of care related to your body affect you. The Flame invites a sense of dignity and wholeness. Ask yourself how you want to be treated and what kind of support respects your needs and decisions.","questions":["What kind of treatment allows me to feel respected?","What comment or expectation would I like to put into words?","What kind of support comes closest to my actual needs?"],"phrase":"My dignity is present, and I can choose respectful care.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","compasion","limites"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"trastorno-obsesivo-compulsivo","title":"Obsessive-compulsive disorder","category":"Mental Health","aliases":["TOC","trastorno obsesivo compulsivo","obsessive-compulsive disorder","obsessive compulsive disorder","OCD","Trastorno obsesivo-compulsivo"],"definition":"A condition characterized by recurring intrusive thoughts and repetitive behaviors or mental acts. Obsessions and compulsions can consume time and significantly affect daily life.","source":{"title":"Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/obsessivecompulsivedisorder.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Finding a gentler relationship with uncertainty","reflection":"You can explore what support makes room for everyday life when uncertainty feels difficult. Here, the Flame is an optional image of companionship. You can contemplate it briefly, set it aside, and talk with someone about what you want to continue cultivating in your day.","questions":["What activity that matters to me would I like to support?","What support makes my day easier without adding new demands?","What do I want to discuss with the professional supporting me?"],"phrase":"I can receive support without having to resolve everything now.","suggestedIntents":["compasion","pedir_apoyo","autoacogida"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"apnea-obstructiva-sueno","title":"Obstructive sleep apnea","category":"Sleep","aliases":["sleep apnea","obstructive apnea","OSA","OSAS","apnea del sueño","apnea obstructiva","AOS","SAOS","Apnea obstructiva del sueño"],"definition":"A disorder in which the airway repeatedly narrows or becomes blocked during sleep, interrupting breathing and breaking up the night's rest.","reflectionHeading":"Receiving support for rest","reflection":"If this experience leaves you frustrated when you wake, you can acknowledge your tiredness without judging yourself for it. In the language of the Flame, receiving care can be an expression of dignity. Contemplation accompanies how you move through the night and day, without replacing your clinical care.","questions":["What feels heaviest today: tiredness, worry, or feeling that others do not understand?","What practical help would make resting feel less lonely?","What everyday demand could you discuss with someone you trust?"],"phrase":"My need for rest deserves understanding and care.","suggestedIntents":["descanso","pedir_apoyo","compasion"],"source":{"title":"Sleep apnea","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/sleepapnea.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"artrosis","title":"Osteoarthritis","category":"Movement And Joints","aliases":["arthrosis","knee osteoarthritis","hip osteoarthritis","osteoartritis","artrosis de rodilla","artrosis de cadera","Artrosis"],"definition":"A joint condition in which the cartilage that helps movement deteriorates. It can cause pain, stiffness, and difficulty moving the affected joint.","source":{"title":"Osteoarthritis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/osteoarthritis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Making room for new ways to take part","reflection":"You can consider which activities are meaningful to you and how you want to continue taking part in them. In this reflection, the Flame accompanies the continuity of your presence, your relationships, and your ability to choose.","questions":["What activity connects me with something I love?","What adaptation or help would I like to discuss?","How can I recognize what is available to me today?"],"phrase":"My presence remains valuable in every way I take part.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","dignidad","pedir_apoyo"]},{"id":"osteoporosis","title":"Osteoporosis","category":"Movement And Joints","aliases":["fragilidad osea","huesos fragiles","perdida de masa osea","osteoporosis","bone fragility","fragile bones","bone loss","Osteoporosis"],"definition":"A condition that weakens bones through changes in their density, structure, or strength. It increases the likelihood of fractures and often develops without obvious symptoms.","source":{"title":"Osteoporosis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/osteoporosis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Staying involved with confidence and support","reflection":"Learning that your bones are more fragile may raise questions about your activities and independence. You can listen to those questions with care. The Flame accompanies a presence that retains the ability to choose: recognizing your preferences, asking for guidance, and exploring what support allows you to keep participating in your life.","questions":["What activity would I like to continue enjoying?","What uncertainty do I need to clarify to feel supported?","What support would best respect my independence?"],"phrase":"I can care for my ability to participate and receive support that respects my choices.","suggestedIntents":["pedir_apoyo","adaptacion","claridad"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"otitis-media","title":"Otitis media","category":"Hearing And Balance","aliases":["infeccion del oido medio","otitis","infeccion de oido","otitis media","middle ear infection","ear infection","Otitis media"],"definition":"Inflammation or infection of the middle ear, the space behind the eardrum. It may involve fluid buildup, discomfort, and temporary changes in hearing.","reflectionHeading":"Offering simple companionship through discomfort","reflection":"When someone feels unwell, a patient presence may be more welcome than many explanations. If you are supporting a child, you can listen to how they express their discomfort without assigning it a hidden emotional meaning. The Flame can be an optional image of companionship, suited to their age and preferences.","questions":["What simple form of company feels pleasant right now?","How is the discomfort being expressed, with or without words?","What does the person offering support also need?"],"phrase":"We can accompany discomfort with patience and attention.","suggestedIntents":["compasion","apoyo","descanso"],"source":{"title":"Ear Infections","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/earinfections.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"pancreatitis","title":"Pancreatitis","category":"Digestive Health","aliases":["inflamacion del pancreas","pancreatitis aguda","pancreatitis cronica","pancreatitis","pancreatic inflammation","acute pancreatitis","chronic pancreatitis","Pancreatitis"],"definition":"Inflammation of the pancreas, an organ involved in digestion and glucose regulation. It can occur acutely or persist as a chronic disease.","source":{"title":"Pancreatitis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/pancreatitis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Returning to what matters in this moment","reflection":"If this experience interrupts your everyday life, you can recognize what is occupying your attention and what support you want. The Flame can represent a close presence as you find words for your emotions and choose whom to share this moment’s questions with.","questions":["What most needs my attention today?","What would I like the people supporting me to know?","What task can I entrust to someone else?"],"phrase":"I can receive support and attend to one moment at a time.","suggestedIntents":["pedir_apoyo","expresion","compasion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"trastorno-panico","title":"Panic disorder","category":"Mental Health","aliases":["trastorno de panico","panic disorder","Trastorno de pánico"],"definition":"A condition involving repeated, unexpected panic attacks, along with worry about their recurrence or changes in behavior that may limit everyday life.","source":{"title":"Panic Disorder","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/panicdisorder.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Receiving companionship in a quiet moment","reflection":"In a quiet moment, you can explore how you want to be supported when an experience frightens you. The image of the Flame can remind you of the presence of real relationships and sources of support. You can choose simple words to express your need and decide how much you want to share.","questions":["What kind of company feels respectful to me?","What would I like to explain to someone I trust?","What everyday place or activity would I like to discuss again with my support team?"],"phrase":"I can give voice to what I need and receive companionship.","suggestedIntents":["apoyo","compasion","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"parkinson","title":"Parkinson's Disease","category":"Neurology","aliases":["Parkinson disease","Parkinson's disease","Parkinson","mal de Parkinson","Enfermedad de Parkinson"],"definition":"A progressive neurological disorder associated with reduced dopamine in the brain. It can cause slowness of movement, stiffness, tremor, and balance difficulties, among other symptoms.","reflectionHeading":"Your own pace, your dignity intact","reflection":"When some actions take more time, you can explore how you would like others to support you. The image of the Flame offers a way to contemplate a dignity that does not depend on the body's speed. There is also room for sadness about changes, without requiring optimism or a spiritual lesson.","questions":["In what situations do you need others to give you more time?","What activity or relationship remains important to you?","How would you like to ask for help while remaining involved in decisions?"],"phrase":"My pace may change; my right to respect remains.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","adaptacion","pedir_apoyo"],"source":{"title":"Parkinson's Disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/parkinsonsdisease.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"ulcera-peptica","title":"Peptic ulcer","category":"Digestive Health","aliases":["ulcera gastrica","ulcera duodenal","ulcera de estomago","peptic ulcer","gastric ulcer","duodenal ulcer","stomach ulcer","Úlcera péptica"],"definition":"An open sore in the lining of the stomach or duodenum, the first part of the small intestine. It can cause pain or burning in the abdomen.","source":{"title":"Peptic Ulcer","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/pepticulcer.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing what you need today","reflection":"You can approach your experience with specific questions and recognize how it is affecting your day. In the language of the Flame, inner presence accompanies the care you choose: asking for information, organizing a conversation, or receiving help with an everyday task.","questions":["What aspect of my day needs more attention?","What information do I want to clarify with the people caring for me?","What practical support could I ask for today?"],"phrase":"I can attend to my needs and make room to receive help.","suggestedIntents":["claridad","apoyo","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"enfermedad-arterial-periferica","title":"Peripheral artery disease","category":"Cardiovascular Health","aliases":["PAD","peripheral vascular disease","peripheral arterial disease","EAP","enfermedad vascular periferica","arteriopatia periferica","Enfermedad arterial periférica"],"definition":"Narrowing of arteries outside the heart, usually from plaque buildup. It can reduce circulation to the limbs, especially the legs, and cause discomfort when walking.","source":{"title":"Peripheral artery disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/peripheralarterialdisease.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing your own way forward","reflection":"If getting around calls for new decisions, you can ask which places, encounters, and activities you want to remain part of. The Flame can be an image of presence in that process. Honor your preferences and explore what practical support would help you participate in what you love.","questions":["What encounter or activity would I like to preserve?","What difficulty do I need to explain clearly?","What practical support could make my day easier?"],"phrase":"I can express my preferences and build support for taking part.","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","dignidad","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"neuropatia-periferica","title":"Peripheral neuropathy","category":"Neurology","aliases":["neuropatia","daño de nervios perifericos","polineuropatia","peripheral neuropathy","peripheral nerve damage","polyneuropathy","neuropathy","Neuropatía periférica"],"definition":"Damage to one or more nerves outside the brain and spinal cord. It can cause pain, tingling, loss of sensation, or weakness, depending on the nerves affected.","reflectionHeading":"Putting words to an experience that is hard to explain","reflection":"Sensations that are difficult to describe can make a conversation about your body exhausting. You can choose simple words, drawings, or silence to express yourself. Here, the Flame serves as an image of companionship: it does not require you to feel anything special or prove your discomfort to deserve understanding and attention.","questions":["What words best describe your experience without minimizing it?","When have you felt understood?","What help with an everyday task would you like to request?"],"phrase":"I do not need to explain my experience perfectly to deserve care.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","autoacogida","pedir_apoyo"],"source":{"title":"Peripheral Nerve Disorders","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/peripheralnervedisorders.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"anemia-perniciosa","title":"Pernicious anemia","category":"Blood","aliases":["intrinsic factor deficiency anemia","Biermer's anemia","anemia por falta de factor intrinseco","anemia de Biermer","Anemia perniciosa"],"definition":"Anemia caused by vitamin B12 deficiency associated with inadequate absorption, usually due to a lack of intrinsic factor. It can affect red blood cell production and the nervous system.","source":{"title":"Pernicious anemia","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/000569.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Making room to understand","reflection":"Learning the name of a condition can bring relief, questions, or mixed feelings. You can take time to receive them. The Flame can accompany a search for understanding: organizing what you want to ask and recognizing how you want to participate in the care becoming part of your life.","questions":["What changed for me when I learned this diagnosis?","What information do I need to hear in clearer words?","What would help me integrate my care into everyday life?"],"phrase":"I can learn at my own pace and express what I need to understand.","suggestedIntents":["claridad","expresion","apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"neumonia","title":"Pneumonia","category":"Infections","aliases":["pulmonia","infeccion pulmonar","pneumonia","lung infection","Neumonía"],"definition":"An infection of one or both lungs in which the air sacs may fill with fluid or pus. Its severity and course vary from person to person.","source":{"title":"Pneumonia","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/pneumonia.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Allowing others to be there for you","reflection":"If this experience has interrupted your routine, you can recognize how you are experiencing the pause and what you need from others. The image of the Flame can accompany a simple moment of inward reflection, with room to receive help and express a specific need.","questions":["What am I finding difficult to delegate right now?","What practical help could I ask for clearly?","What words would I like to hear as I care for myself?"],"phrase":"I can receive help and make room for my care.","suggestedIntents":["pedir_apoyo","descanso","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"ovario-poliquistico","title":"Polycystic ovary syndrome","category":"Hormonal Health","aliases":["SOP","ovarios poliquisticos","PCOS","SOMP","polycystic ovary syndrome","polycystic ovaries","Síndrome de ovario poliquístico"],"definition":"A group of hormonal changes that may include irregular ovulation, excess androgens, and changes in the ovaries. Its features and effects vary from person to person.","source":{"title":"Polycystic Ovary Syndrome","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/polycysticovarysyndrome.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Listening to your own wishes","reflection":"You can explore how this experience intersects with your wishes, body image, or life plans. The Flame offers an image of listening in which your voice has a place. Each question can open a conversation you choose, at your own pace.","questions":["What wish of my own would I like to distinguish from other people’s expectations?","What aspect of my experience do I need to understand better?","What conversation do I want to have about my plans or intimacy?"],"phrase":"My wishes and questions can have a voice of their own.","suggestedIntents":["eleccion_consciente","expresion","autoacogida"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"estres-postraumatico","title":"Post-traumatic stress disorder","category":"Mental Health","aliases":["TEPT","PTSD","estres postraumatico","post-traumatic stress disorder","posttraumatic stress disorder","post-traumatic stress","Trastorno de estrés postraumático"],"definition":"A condition that can develop after experiencing or witnessing a traumatic event. It may involve intrusive memories, avoidance, mood changes, and persistent alertness.","source":{"title":"Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/posttraumaticstressdisorder.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Respecting your pace and your choices","reflection":"You can focus this reflection on the present and on the conditions that allow you to feel supported. If the image of the Flame feels pleasant, receive it as a quiet presence. Your choice about how much to share, with whom, and when retains its place.","questions":["What helps me recognize that I am here, in this moment?","What conditions do I need for a respectful conversation?","What would I prefer to keep to myself today?"],"phrase":"My pace and my choices deserve respect.","suggestedIntents":["limites","apoyo","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"cancer-prostata","title":"Prostate cancer","category":"Cancer Support","aliases":["prostate cancer","prostatic cancer","cancer prostatico","Cáncer de próstata"],"definition":"Cancer that begins in the cells of the prostate. Its behavior varies: some cancers grow slowly, while others may progress or spread to other parts of the body.","source":{"title":"Prostate cancer","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/prostatecancer.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Opening a conversation on your own terms","reflection":"You can make room for questions that may feel personal or difficult to express. The Flame can accompany you as an image of respectful listening. Your experience of intimacy, relationships, and everyday changes deserves your own words and people who can receive them.","questions":["What question have I been putting off?","With whom would I like to discuss my personal concerns?","What kind of practical help would be welcome?"],"phrase":"My personal questions deserve a respectful conversation.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","confianza_discernida","claridad"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"psoriasis","title":"Psoriasis","category":"Skin","aliases":["psoriasis en placas","psoriasis cutanea","psoriasis","plaque psoriasis","cutaneous psoriasis","Psoriasis"],"definition":"An immune-related disease that speeds up skin cell turnover. It can produce thickened, scaly areas of skin that may itch or hurt.","source":{"title":"Psoriasis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/psoriasis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Keeping a broad view of yourself","reflection":"Your view of yourself can include your relationships, abilities, and what you love. You can contemplate the Flame as an image of that complete presence and explore how you want to participate in your relationships.","questions":["What aspects of myself would I like to recognize today?","What do I need to feel respected in my relationships?","With whom can I share my experience freely?"],"phrase":"I can see myself broadly and choose how I share my experience.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","confianza_discernida","expresion"]},{"id":"artritis-psoriasica","title":"Psoriatic arthritis","category":"Movement And Joints","aliases":["psoriatic arthritis","arthritic psoriasis","psoriatic arthropathy","artritis psoriasica","psoriasis artritica","artropatia psoriasica","Artritis psoriásica"],"definition":"An inflammatory joint disease associated with psoriasis that can cause pain, stiffness, and swelling. Skin and joint symptoms may appear at different times.","source":{"title":"Psoriatic arthritis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/psoriaticarthritis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing the different parts of your experience","reflection":"You can make room for changes in your activities and for how you feel about your appearance. The Flame can accompany both experiences with the same kind presence, from which you can choose the need you want to express and the support you want to receive.","questions":["What part of my experience needs to be heard today?","What activity would I like to keep sharing with other people?","What practical help could make that encounter easier?"],"phrase":"I can receive my whole experience and give voice to what I need.","suggestedIntents":["autoacogida","adaptacion","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"fibrosis-pulmonar","title":"Pulmonary Fibrosis","category":"Respiratory Health","aliases":["pulmonary fibrosis","lung scarring","idiopathic pulmonary fibrosis","cicatrizacion pulmonar","fibrosis pulmonar idiopatica","Fibrosis pulmonar"],"definition":"Scarring of tissue deep in the lungs that makes it thicker and stiffer. This can make breathing and the passage of oxygen into the blood more difficult.","source":{"title":"Pulmonary Fibrosis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/pulmonaryfibrosis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Finding companionship in uncertainty","reflection":"You can explore the questions that arise when you imagine your day or look ahead. In a quiet moment, the Flame can represent companionship as you recognize your feelings, prepare for a conversation, and choose what information or closeness you want to receive today.","questions":["What question is occupying my attention?","What do I want to discuss with those involved in my care?","What kind of companionship feels valuable to me today?"],"phrase":"I can share my questions and receive companionship in this moment.","suggestedIntents":["incertidumbre","pedir_apoyo","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"piernas-inquietas","title":"Restless legs syndrome","category":"Sleep","aliases":["sindrome de las piernas inquietas","SPI","enfermedad de Willis-Ekbom","restless legs syndrome","RLS","Willis-Ekbom disease","Síndrome de piernas inquietas"],"definition":"A disorder that creates an intense urge to move the legs, usually accompanied by unpleasant sensations at rest. It may interfere with falling asleep and staying asleep.","reflectionHeading":"Without demanding perfect stillness of yourself","reflection":"If discomfort makes it difficult to stay still, you do not have to turn contemplation into another test. You can approach the language of the Flame in a form and for a length of time that feel kind to you. Physical restlessness does not indicate personal failure or a lack of spiritual willingness.","questions":["What demands do you place on yourself when trying to rest?","What kind of company feels pleasant on a difficult night?","What would you like the people you live with to understand about this experience?"],"phrase":"I do not need perfect stillness to treat myself kindly.","suggestedIntents":["descanso","compasion","apoyo"],"source":{"title":"Restless Legs Syndrome","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/restlesslegs.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"artritis-reumatoide","title":"Rheumatoid arthritis","category":"Movement And Joints","aliases":["RA","rheumatoid arthritis","rheumatism","AR","artritis reumatoidea","reuma","Artritis reumatoide"],"definition":"An autoimmune disease that causes inflammation, pain, and stiffness in the joints. It can also affect other tissues and organs; it differs from osteoarthritis.","source":{"title":"Rheumatoid arthritis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/rheumatoidarthritis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Listening to yourself as days change","reflection":"If what you can do changes from day to day, you can recognize what each moment calls for. The Flame accompanies a patient relationship with yourself: making room for your emotions, expressing your boundaries, and receiving companionship.","questions":["How am I experiencing the changes in my everyday life?","What do I want to communicate when I need to adjust a commitment?","Who can listen without asking me to explain everything?"],"phrase":"I can listen to the day I am living and treat myself with respect.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["adaptacion","limites","autoacogida"]},{"id":"rosacea","title":"Rosacea","category":"Skin","aliases":["acne rosacea","rosacea facial","rosacea","facial rosacea","Rosácea"],"definition":"A chronic condition that commonly causes redness and small lesions on the face. In some people, it also affects the eyes, causing discomfort such as dryness or irritation.","source":{"title":"Rosacea","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/rosacea.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Meeting others with your own voice","reflection":"If visible changes in your skin affect how you feel when meeting other people, you can make room for that experience. The Flame accompanies a respectful view of yourself and the possibility of expressing how you want to be treated.","questions":["How do I feel when taking part in a social gathering?","What do I need to feel respected in a conversation?","What part of myself would I like to share beyond my appearance?"],"phrase":"I can meet others with my own voice and dignity.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","expresion","limites"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"esclerodermia","title":"Scleroderma","category":"Autoimmune Conditions","aliases":["scleroderma","systemic sclerosis","localized scleroderma","esclerosis sistemica","esclerodermia localizada","Esclerodermia"],"definition":"An autoimmune disease that causes inflammation and thickening of the skin. Some forms also affect blood vessels and internal organs, with manifestations that differ from person to person.","source":{"title":"Scleroderma","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/scleroderma.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Keeping your place in decisions","reflection":"When changes appear in your body or your activities, you can explore which decisions you want to understand and share. The Flame invites you to recognize your own voice, the questions you want to ask, and the help that can accompany each step of your life.","questions":["What change is asking for more of my attention?","What information do I need to understand before making a decision?","How do I want to take part in conversations about my care?"],"phrase":"I can ask, understand, and participate with my own voice.","suggestedIntents":["eleccion_consciente","expresion","pedir_apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"alergia-estacional","title":"Seasonal allergies","category":"Allergies","aliases":["seasonal allergic rhinitis","hay fever","pollen allergy","rinitis alergica estacional","fiebre del heno","alergia al polen","Alergia estacional"],"definition":"An allergic reaction to substances such as pollen that are present at certain times of year. It can cause sneezing, nasal congestion, and itchy eyes, nose, or throat.","source":{"title":"Allergic rhinitis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/hayfever.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Attending to the small things that fill your day","reflection":"Sometimes a recurring discomfort takes more of your attention than others realize. You can recognize which parts of your day are affected and what you want to communicate. The Flame invites you to listen kindly to these specific needs, even when they seem small.","questions":["What part of my day is becoming more difficult?","What do I need to explain so others can understand my experience?","What act of kindness would I like to offer myself today?"],"phrase":"I can listen to my everyday needs and make room for them.","suggestedIntents":["compasion","expresion","claridad"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"sinusitis","title":"Sinusitis","category":"Ear, Nose, And Throat","aliases":["rinosinusitis","infeccion de senos paranasales","sinusitis cronica","sinusitis","rhinosinusitis","sinus infection","chronic sinusitis","Sinusitis"],"definition":"Inflammation of the sinuses, the cavities around the nose. It can cause congestion, facial pressure or pain, and discharge, and may be short-lived or persistent.","reflectionHeading":"Making room for a day when you have less to give","reflection":"Congestion and discomfort can make everyday tasks feel harder. You can reconsider how much you want to take on today and communicate it without guilt. The image of the Flame accompanies that act of care; contemplation does not require forced breathing, fragrances, or proving your ability to endure discomfort.","questions":["What task could you share or postpone without asking too much of yourself?","What do you need to explain about how you feel today?","What kind of company feels pleasant when you have less energy for conversation?"],"phrase":"I can recognize today’s limits and ask for consideration.","suggestedIntents":["descanso","limites","apoyo"],"source":{"title":"Sinusitis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/sinusitis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"sjogren","title":"Sjögren syndrome","category":"Autoimmune Conditions","aliases":["enfermedad de Sjogren","sindrome de Sjogren","Sjogren","Sjögren syndrome","Sjogren syndrome","Sjogren's syndrome","Sjögren disease","Sjogren disease","Síndrome de Sjögren"],"definition":"An autoimmune disease that particularly affects the glands producing tears and saliva. It can cause dry eyes and mouth, along with effects in other parts of the body.","source":{"title":"Sjögren Disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/sjogrensdisease.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Valuing everyday needs","reflection":"You can explore how small, recurring discomforts affect your day and what you would like others to understand. In contemplation of the Flame, those needs can receive attention and words, alongside your wishes for conversation, companionship, and participation.","questions":["What everyday situation would I like to make more manageable?","What do I need to explain to the people who share my day?","What moment of companionship would I like to nurture?"],"phrase":"My everyday needs deserve attention and clear words.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","apoyo","compasion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"enfermedad-hepatica-esteatosica","title":"Steatotic Liver Disease","category":"Liver Health","aliases":["fatty liver disease","hepatic steatosis","steatotic liver disease","MASLD","MASH","higado graso","esteatosis hepatica","Enfermedad hepática esteatósica"],"definition":"An excessive buildup of fat in the liver. It includes different forms, some related to metabolic changes, and in certain cases may involve inflammation and liver damage.","source":{"title":"Steatotic Liver Disease","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/steatoticliverdisease.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Building a respectful relationship with your care","reflection":"You can ask yourself how you relate to the information you receive about your health and what support would make everyday care easier. In contemplation, the Flame invites a patient, dignified outlook that can listen to questions and recognize possible next steps.","questions":["How do I feel about the information I have received?","What do I need to clarify so I can take part in my care?","What kind of companionship helps me follow through on my decisions?"],"phrase":"I can take part in my care with dignity and understanding.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","constancia_cuidada","claridad"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"cefalea-tensional","title":"Tension headache","category":"Neurology","aliases":["tension-type headache","tension headache","headache","dolor de cabeza tensional","cefalea por tension","dolor de cabeza","Cefalea tensional"],"definition":"A common type of headache that often feels like pressure or a tight band. It may be accompanied by tenderness in the neck or scalp muscles.","source":{"title":"Tension headache","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ency/article/000797.htm","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Listening to the present moment","reflection":"You can make room to notice how you are experiencing this moment. The image of the Flame accompanies open listening: recognizing what you feel, naming a need, and choosing what you want to put into practice.","questions":["What do I notice about my mood right now?","What do I need to express in simple words?","What activity or conversation could I organize differently?"],"phrase":"I give myself a moment to listen and choose with clarity.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["autoacogida","expresion","eleccion_consciente"]},{"id":"tinnitus","title":"Tinnitus","category":"Hearing And Balance","aliases":["acufenos","zumbido en los oidos","silbidos en los oidos","tinnitus","ringing in the ears","ear ringing","whistling in the ears","Tinnitus"],"definition":"The perception of sounds, such as ringing or whistling, without a corresponding external sound source. It may affect one or both ears and vary in intensity and duration.","reflectionHeading":"Not requiring silence to deserve a pause","reflection":"If the sound occupies your attention, you may feel frustrated when someone asks you simply to ignore it. This reflection does not require inner or outer silence. The Flame can be a chosen image of gentle presence as you acknowledge what you are experiencing and decide what support you want to receive.","questions":["What comments about your experience help you, and which make you uncomfortable?","What would you like to communicate about its impact on your day?","What expectation of perfect silence can you leave out of your practice?"],"phrase":"I can acknowledge what I hear without judging myself for how it affects me.","suggestedIntents":["compasion","descanso","expresion"],"source":{"title":"Tinnitus","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/tinnitus.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"neuralgia-trigemino","title":"Trigeminal neuralgia","category":"Neurology","aliases":["tic doloroso","neuralgia trigeminal","trigeminal neuralgia","tic douloureux","Neuralgia del trigémino"],"definition":"A facial pain disorder involving the trigeminal nerve. It can cause intense, brief episodes resembling electric shocks, usually on one side of the face.","reflectionHeading":"Making room for pain without being defined by it","reflection":"When pain interrupts simple actions, it can be difficult to explain how much of your day it occupies. This reflection offers room to acknowledge it without making it your entire identity. You can imagine the Flame as quiet company, without asking yourself to speak, smile, or maintain a particular attitude.","questions":["What part of this experience is hardest to communicate?","What kind of company best respects your need for silence?","What act of consideration would help you feel less alone?"],"phrase":"I deserve respectful company, even when I have no words.","suggestedIntents":["compasion","dignidad","limites"],"source":{"title":"Trigeminal Neuralgia","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/trigeminalneuralgia.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"tuberculosis","title":"Tuberculosis","category":"Infections","aliases":["TB","infeccion tuberculosa","tuberculosis","tuberculous infection","Tuberculosis"],"definition":"A bacterial disease that usually affects the lungs, though it can involve other organs. The infection may remain inactive or develop into active disease.","source":{"title":"Tuberculosis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/tuberculosis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Sustaining connections during care","reflection":"You can explore how you want to maintain your relationships as you move through this process. The Flame offers an image of companionship and dignity that can be present in a conversation, in shared silence, or in expressing what you need to understand.","questions":["With whom would I like to have a close conversation?","What information do I need to understand better about my process?","What gesture of companionship would help me feel recognized?"],"phrase":"I can move through this process with dignity, information, and companionship.","suggestedIntents":["reciprocidad","pedir_apoyo","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"diabetes-tipo-1","title":"Type 1 diabetes","category":"Metabolic Health","aliases":["type one diabetes","insulin-dependent diabetes","juvenile diabetes","diabetes tipo uno","diabetes insulinodependiente","diabetes juvenil","Diabetes tipo 1"],"definition":"A disease in which the body produces little or no insulin, usually because the cells that make it are destroyed by an autoimmune process. Glucose builds up in the blood.","source":{"title":"Type 1 diabetes","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/diabetestype1.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Caring for yourself while keeping your own life","reflection":"Care decisions can take up a great deal of the day. You can explore how you want to share that responsibility and preserve time for what you enjoy. The Flame accompanies your whole presence: your projects, relationships, and needs also deserve attention.","questions":["What part of my care would I like to share or explain more clearly?","What activity connects me with enjoyment?","What do I need others to respect about my decisions?"],"phrase":"My care can coexist with my projects and my own voice.","suggestedIntents":["constancia_cuidada","limites","reciprocidad"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"diabetes-tipo-2","title":"Type 2 diabetes","category":"Metabolic Health","aliases":["type two diabetes","type 2 diabetes mellitus","high blood glucose","diabetes tipo dos","diabetes mellitus tipo 2","glucosa elevada","Diabetes tipo 2"],"definition":"A disease in which blood glucose remains too high because the body does not use insulin properly or does not produce enough for its needs.","source":{"title":"Type 2 diabetes","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/diabetestype2.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Caring for yourself with dignity","reflection":"Care routines can be part of your life in different ways. You can explore how you relate to them and what support you want. In the language of the Flame, each conscious gesture is an opportunity to participate in your life with dignity.","questions":["What part of my care am I managing to sustain?","Where would practical help be useful?","How do I want to speak to myself when a day is difficult?"],"phrase":"My care can grow with patience, dignity, and companionship.","editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","constancia_cuidada","pedir_apoyo"]},{"id":"colitis-ulcerosa","title":"Ulcerative colitis","category":"Digestive Health","aliases":["ulcerative colitis","ulcerative proctocolitis","colitis ulcerativa","rectocolitis ulcerosa","Colitis ulcerosa"],"definition":"An inflammatory bowel disease that causes inflammation and ulcers in the lining of the colon and rectum. It can cause diarrhea, bleeding, and abdominal pain.","source":{"title":"Ulcerative colitis","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/ulcerativecolitis.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Preserving privacy and companionship","reflection":"You can choose which parts of your experience you want to share and which you want to keep to yourself. Contemplating the Flame offers an image of acceptance: listening to what you need, honoring your privacy, and opening conversations with people who can accompany you respectfully.","questions":["What do I need others to understand about my daily life?","What would I prefer to share, and what do I want to keep private?","What practical help would make an important activity easier for me?"],"phrase":"My privacy and my need for companionship can both have room.","suggestedIntents":["limites","confianza_discernida","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"incontinencia-urinaria","title":"Urinary Incontinence","category":"Kidney And Urinary Health","aliases":["urinary incontinence","urine leakage","bladder leakage","loss of bladder control","perdida de orina","escapes de orina","perdida de control de la vejiga","Incontinencia urinaria"],"definition":"Involuntary leakage of urine due to difficulty controlling the bladder. There are several types with different features and causes, and it can affect daily activities.","source":{"title":"Urinary Incontinence","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/urinaryincontinence.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Taking part with respect for yourself","reflection":"You can explore how to keep space for the activities and relationships that matter to you. The Flame can accompany a dignified view of your experience, from which you recognize your preferences, protect your privacy, and choose how to discuss the support you need.","questions":["What activity would I like to experience with greater ease?","What do I need to feel respected when talking about this?","What help or adjustment would I like to be able to discuss?"],"phrase":"I can protect my privacy and keep making room for what I love.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","limites","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"infeccion-urinaria","title":"Urinary Tract Infection","category":"Kidney And Urinary Health","aliases":["urinary tract infection","UTI","urinary infection","infeccion de vias urinarias","ITU","infeccion del tracto urinario","Infección urinaria"],"definition":"An infection affecting part of the urinary system, such as the bladder, urethra, or kidneys. It can cause discomfort during urination and changes in how often you urinate.","source":{"title":"Urinary Tract Infections","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/urinarytractinfections.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Recognizing a specific need","reflection":"You can make room to describe what you are experiencing and recognize how it affects your day. Contemplating the Flame invites kind attention, where your everyday needs find words and you can choose whom to ask for information or help.","questions":["What do I need to explain precisely?","What part of my day needs a temporary adjustment?","How can I ask for help in a way that feels comfortable?"],"phrase":"I can attend to my experience and express a specific need.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","claridad","compasion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"miomas-uterinos","title":"Uterine fibroids","category":"Gynecological Health","aliases":["fibromas uterinos","fibroides uterinos","leiomiomas uterinos","uterine fibroids","uterine myomas","uterine leiomyomas","Miomas uterinos"],"definition":"Benign growths made of muscle and other tissues that develop within or around the uterine wall. Their size, number, and symptoms can vary.","source":{"title":"Uterine Fibroids","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/uterinefibroids.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Preparing a conversation that represents you","reflection":"You can consider which aspects of your experience you would like to explain more clearly. The Flame can accompany your intention to take part in conversations about your care. Your daily life, questions, and preferences can have a specific place in what you choose to share.","questions":["What change in my day would I like to describe more clearly?","What question do I need to bring to my next appointment?","What personal preference do I want others to understand?"],"phrase":"I can give words to my experience and my preferences.","suggestedIntents":["expresion","claridad","apoyo"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"varices","title":"Varicose veins","category":"Cardiovascular Health","aliases":["varices","venas varicosas","venas dilatadas","varicose veins","enlarged veins","Várices"],"definition":"Enlarged, twisted veins visible beneath the skin, most often in the legs. They may involve heaviness, pain, or other discomfort, although some cause no symptoms.","source":{"title":"Varicose Veins","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/varicoseveins.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Listening to your everyday preferences","reflection":"You can explore how you are experiencing discomfort or visible changes in your legs. Contemplation of the Flame invites you to recognize your comfort and preferences. Perhaps you want to discuss your tasks, your rest, or the way you see yourself.","questions":["What part of my day would I like to organize differently?","How do I want to speak to myself when looking at my body?","What preference do I need to express to the people who share my day?"],"phrase":"My comfort and preferences deserve a place in my day.","suggestedIntents":["descanso","compasion","expresion"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"vertigo","title":"Vertigo","category":"Hearing And Balance","aliases":["sensacion de giro","vertigo posicional","mareo con giro","vertigo","spinning sensation","positional vertigo","spinning dizziness","Vértigo"],"definition":"A sensation that you or your surroundings are spinning while still. It is a symptom with several possible causes and may involve nausea or unsteadiness.","reflectionHeading":"Accepting company when you feel less secure","reflection":"The spinning sensation can change your confidence in everyday activities. You can recognize that uncertainty and discuss the help you want. The image of the Flame is offered as a symbolic point of companionship, without asking you to close your eyes, visualize movement, or test your balance.","questions":["What everyday situation is creating the most uncertainty for you now?","What kind of support would help you feel respected?","What need can you communicate before trying to meet someone else’s expectation?"],"phrase":"Asking for company is also a way of caring for my independence.","suggestedIntents":["apoyo","pedir_apoyo","limites"],"source":{"title":"Dizziness and Vertigo","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/dizzinessandvertigo.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-27"},"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"},{"id":"vitiligo","title":"Vitiligo","category":"Skin","aliases":["vitiligo","despigmentacion por vitiligo","vitiligo depigmentation","Vitíligo"],"definition":"Loss of pigmentation that creates lighter areas of skin as pigment-producing cells disappear. It may also affect the hair and certain mucous membranes.","source":{"title":"Vitiligo","url":"https://medlineplus.gov/spanish/vitiligo.html","organization":"MedlinePlus · U.S. National Library of Medicine","verifiedDate":"2026-10-26"},"reflectionHeading":"Being at home in your appearance on your own terms","reflection":"You can ask how you want to relate to your appearance and to the way other people look at you. The Flame can accompany a presence of your own, where your preferences and boundaries find words and your relationships have room to recognize you as a whole person.","questions":["How do I want to relate to my appearance today?","What questions about my skin do I want to answer, and which would I prefer to keep private?","What people recognize me in a broad and personal way?"],"phrase":"I can be at home in my appearance and choose how I participate in my relationships.","suggestedIntents":["dignidad","limites","autoacogida"],"editorialStatus":"propuesta_editorial"}]};
